#. emotion: Reflectively nostalgic
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Compared to where she had grown up in Rosanna, Gallow's Creek was tiny."
msgstr "По сравнению с Розанной, где она выросла, Галлоус-Крик был крошечным."

#. emotion: Sternly demanding
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Complete submission."
