msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't believe everything they tell you. Soldier's can be worse than midwives when it comes to telling tall tales."
msgstr "Не верь всему, что говорят. Солдаты могут быть хуже сплетниц, когда дело доходит до небылиц."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't bother arguing with him"
msgstr "Не утруждать себя спорами с ним"

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Brigand"
msgid "Don't bother covering up. I've seen all of it and before long I'll be up inside of you."
msgstr "Даже не пытайся прикрываться. Я уже всё видел, и скоро я буду внутри тебя."

#. emotion: In a concerned and caring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't bother getting dressed."
msgstr "Можешь не одеваться."

#. emotion: In a comforting, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't bother with that, Blondie."
msgstr "Не утруждай себя, Блонди."

#. emotion: Detachedly skeptical
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Don't bother with the excuses."
msgstr "Не утруждай себя оправданиями."

#. emotion: Warily suggesting calm
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't bully me Nick, please, not you."
msgstr "Не мучай меня, Ник, пожалуйста, только не ты."

#. emotion: In a stern, protective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Don't call her that."
msgstr "Не называй её так."

#. emotion: Disapprovingly shouting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't call me a moron!"
msgstr "Не называй меня дурой!"

#. emotion: Warily whispering
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't call me by my first name, street rat."
msgstr "Не называй меня по имени, уличная крыса."

#. emotion: Irritated but playful
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't call me girly!"
msgstr "Не называй меня девонькой!"

#. emotion: Confidently rejecting condescension
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't call me girly."
msgstr "Не называй меня девонькой."

#. emotion: Annoyed, sharply
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't call me that!"
msgstr "Не называй меня так!"

#. emotion: Defensively irritated
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't call me that."
msgstr "Не называй меня так."

#. emotion: Aggressively warning
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't come any closer or I'll burn you!"
msgstr "Не подходи ближе, или я сожгу тебя!"

#. emotion: Motivatingly encouraging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't complain, be strong, she reminded herself."
msgstr "Не жалуйся, будь сильной, напомнила она себе."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't confide in Sigmund"
msgstr "Не доверяться Сигмунду"

#. emotion: Quietly anxious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't cry out. Don't let anyone hear you, she commanded herself. Don't let him hear."
msgstr "Не кричи. Не дай никому услышать тебя, приказала она себе. Не дай ему услышать."

#. emotion: Tense, apprehensive whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't cry. Your life is in the balance, one mistake and who knew what would happen. That vile criminal could find her, or who knew what worse this city had in store."
msgstr "Не плачь. Твоя жизнь на волоске, одна ошибка — и кто знает, что случится. Этот гнусный преступник может найти её, или кто знает, какие ещё ужасы таит этот город."

#. emotion: Tense yet pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't deny it, Kate. Save yourself and myself the disgrace of lying."
msgstr "Не отрицай, Кейт. Избавь себя и меня от позора лжи."

#. emotion: Confidently, with pride
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Don't deny it. I'm not stupid."
msgstr "Не отрицай. Я не глупая."

#. emotion: Sternly forbidding
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't do that."
msgstr "Не делай этого."

#. emotion: In an authoritative, confident tone
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Don't even make eye contact with them. You are Jaeid's property, and so by extension, you are beyond them."
msgstr "Даже не смотри им в глаза. Ты собственность Джейда, и, соответственно, ты выше их."

#. emotion: Surprised, gentle curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Don't even worry about it."
msgstr "Даже не переживай."

#. emotion: Calmly and firmly, with a sense of importance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't ever repeat that to anyone, do you understand?"
msgstr "Никогда никому не повторяй этого, ты понял?"

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Don't expect that you'll master the oldest art in a few months."
msgstr "Не жди, что ты овладеешь древнейшим искусством за несколько месяцев."

#. emotion: Somberly warning
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Don't expect too friendly a welcome though."
msgstr "Но не жди слишком дружелюбного приёма."

#. emotion: Detachedly neutral
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Don't feel bad about it."
msgstr "Не кори себя."

#. emotion: Comfortingly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't feel bad about it. It's good that you came to me for advice, that's what your advisors are for."
msgstr "Не расстраивайся из-за этого. Хорошо, что ты пришла ко мне за советом, для того и нужны советники."

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't feel bad about it. The lying, I mean."
msgstr "Не вини себя за это. За ложь, я имею в виду."

#. emotion: Detached, mildly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Don't feel bad. It does the same to me."
msgstr "Не кори себя. Со мной происходит то же самое."

#. emotion: Firmly, with authority
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "Don't fidget so much."
msgstr "Не дёргайся так."

#. emotion: Sternly admonishing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't flatter yourself. You're a tool to an end."
msgstr "Не льсти себе. Ты всего лишь средство для достижения цели."

#. emotion: Warily amused
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't forget the clit."
msgstr "Не забывай про клитор."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't forget the deal, Blondie."
msgstr "Не забывай об уговоре, Блонди."

#. emotion: Calmly reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't forget those."
msgstr "Не забудь вон те."

#. emotion: Urgently demanding, with a slight edge of impatience
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't forget to burn those."
msgstr "Не забудь сжечь это."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Don't forget yourself."
msgstr "Не забывайся."

#. emotion: In a resigned, defeated tone
msgctxt "speaker:Female Soldier"
msgid "Don't fucking get me started on that. Nothin but bleedin money since I started."
msgstr "Даже не начинай. Я только проигрываю деньги с самого начала."

#. emotion: In a resigned, defeated tone
msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "Don't fucking get me started on that. Nothin but bleedin money since I started."
msgstr "Даже не начинай. Я только проигрываю деньги с самого начала."

#. emotion: In a low menacing whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't fucking whisper it!"
msgstr "Не смей шептать, мать твою!"

#. emotion: Flatly, dismissively
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't get any ideas."
msgstr "Никаких идей."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't get cute with me girl."
msgstr "Не умничай, девочка."

#. emotion: Firmly, with authority
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't get distracted."
msgstr "Не отвлекайся."

#. emotion: Carefully encouraging
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't get seperated from us, ok?"
msgstr "Не отставай от нас, ладно?"

#. emotion: In a mildly dismissive tone
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't get too excited. The Mythrans have an obsession with old artifacts."
msgstr "Не слишком обнадёживайся. У митранцев навязчивая идея со старыми артефактами."

#. emotion: In a gentle, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "Don't get too used to it."
msgstr "Не привыкай."

#. emotion: Calm, reassuring whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Don't give him a reason to punish you again."
msgstr "Не давай ему повода снова наказывать тебя."

#. emotion: In a hushed, secretive tone
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Don't go around telling that to the townsfolk."
msgstr "Не рассказывай об этом горожанам."

#. emotion: Delicately, with encouragement
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Don't go causin trouble on your first day, alright?"
msgstr "Не создавай проблем в первый же день, хорошо?"

#. emotion: In a stern, disappointed tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't go doing this cause of me!"
msgstr "Не делай этого из-за меня!"

#. emotion: Sternly warning
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Don't go falling in love now."
msgstr "Только не влюбись."

#. emotion: In a playful teasing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't go gettin an attitude now blondie."
msgstr "Не зазнавайся, блондинка."

#. emotion: In an amused, teasing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't go givin me that attitude neither, Blondie."
msgstr "Не строй мне такое выражение лица, Блонди."

#. emotion: Sternly warning, with a firm tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't go making promises you can't keep."
msgstr "Не давай обещаний, которые не сможешь сдержать."

#. emotion: With a gentle, encouraging tone
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't go off like last night now."
msgstr "Только не кончи, как прошлой ночью."

#. emotion: Worriedly pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Don't go so fast!"
msgstr "Не уходи так быстро!"

#. emotion: Sarcastically questioning
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't go tellin me you got sympathy for the kid?"
msgstr "Не говори мне, что ты сочувствуешь парню?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing, yet somewhat puzzled
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't go thinkin I mind you bein here, but I also gotta keep the ship sailin."
msgstr "Не думай, что я против того, что ты здесь, но мне ещё нужно вести корабль."

#. emotion: Frustrated caution
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't go thinking you can do me like this every night..."
msgstr "Не думай, что сможешь так делать со мной каждую ночь..."

#. emotion: Protectively, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't go too far away from me."
msgstr "Не отходи от меня далеко."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't go too hard on yourself. I've been at this a lot longer than you have."
msgstr "Не кори себя. Я занимаюсь этим гораздо дольше тебя."

#. emotion: Defensively, with a hint of accusation
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't go trying to blame me."
msgstr "Не пытайся свалить вину на меня."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't hold back"
msgstr "Не сдерживайся."

#. emotion: In a concerned and stern whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't joke about a man's dick like that."
msgstr "Не шути так о мужском члене."

#. emotion: Aggressively admonishing
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Don't just take off like that!"
msgstr "Не срывайся вот так!"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't kiss Nick"
msgstr "Не целовать Ника"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't know?"
msgstr "Не знаю?"

#. emotion: In a concerned, pleading tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't leave for another five years though."
msgstr "Только не уходи снова на пять лет."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't let go, Lethram is a big city, and you don't want to end up lost."
msgstr "Не отпускай, Летрем — большой город, и ты не захочешь тут заблудиться."

#. emotion: Warily admonishing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't let her fool ya. She can work plenty hard."
msgstr "Не дай себя обмануть. Она умеет работать очень усердно."

#. emotion: In a low menacing whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't let him charm you, he's as much a bastard as the rest of us."
msgstr "Не позволяй ему очаровать тебя, он такой же ублюдок, как и все мы."

#. emotion: Alert and watchful
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Don't let me get in the way, go right ahead. The library is off that way, but I imagine you know your way around the castle."
msgstr "Не позволяй мне мешать, проходи. Библиотека в той стороне, но, полагаю, ты знаешь замок."

#. emotion: Cautiously warning
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't let them rob you like they always do."
msgstr "Не дай им обобрать тебя, как обычно."

#. emotion: Anxiously pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't let this happen to me."
msgstr "Не дай этому случиться со мной."

#. emotion: Emotionally intense, concerned plea
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't let your mind drift dear. I want you to be present in the moment."
msgstr "Не позволяй мыслям блуждать, дорогая. Я хочу, чтобы ты была здесь и сейчас."

#. emotion: Surprised, slightly urgent
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "Don't linger there. Come in, sit here."
msgstr "Не стой там. Заходи, садись сюда."

#. emotion: Urgently excited
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't linger!"
msgstr "Не задерживайся!"

#. emotion: In a stern, protective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't listen to her Samayra. I'm a real mean bitch!"
msgstr "Не слушай её, Самайра. Я настоящая злобная стерва!"

#. emotion: In a stern, cautionary tone
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Don't listen to the poison that she is trying to spread."
msgstr "Не слушай яд, который она пытается распространять."

#. emotion: Contemplatively watching
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't look down, she thought to herself at the halfway point."
msgstr "Не смотри вниз, подумала она про себя на середине пути."

#. emotion: Detachedly ignoring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't look. Don't be seen. Don't be heard."
msgstr "Не смотреть. Не быть замеченной. Не быть услышанной."

#. emotion: Annoyed but patient
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't make a big deal out of it, alright."
msgstr "Не придавай этому значения, ладно."

#. emotion: Whispering softly, with secrecy
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't make a sound."
msgstr "Не издавай ни звука."

#. emotion: With a gentle reprimand
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't make love to me."
msgstr "Не занимайся со мной любовью."

#. emotion: In a flat, slightly impatient tone
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't make me ask again."
msgstr "Не заставляй меня повторять."

#. emotion: Firmly, with authority
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Don't make me regret this, Alaric."
msgstr "Не заставь меня пожалеть об этом, Аларик."

#. emotion: In a frustrated, angry outburst
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Don't make me repeat myself, bitch!"
msgstr "Не заставляй меня повторять, сука!"

#. emotion: Softly, with a hint of mystery
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't mean nothing to you, but he means a little something to me."
msgstr "Тебе он ни о чём не говорит, но для меня он кое-что значит."

#. emotion: Cautiously ignoring
msgctxt "speaker:Elsa"
msgid "Don't mind him."
msgstr "Не обращай на него внимания."

#. emotion: Determinedly, with resolve
msgctxt "speaker:Female Soldier"
msgid "Don't mind if I do."
msgstr "Не откажусь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't pay them no mind. Just busy bodies out there with too much gossip and too much time."
msgstr "Не обращай внимания. Просто любопытные носы, которым нечем заняться."

#. emotion: In a sternly compassionate tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't play a fool, Marius."
msgstr "Не строй из себя дурака, Мариус."

#. emotion: Disappointed, gently advising
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "Don't play a fool, girl. It doesn't suit you."
msgstr "Не строй из себя дурочку, девочка. Тебе не идёт."

#. emotion: Reflectively remembering
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't press, she reminded herself."
msgstr "Не настаивай, напомнила она себе."

#. emotion: In a stern, commanding tone
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Don't pretend like you didn't have options."
msgstr "Не притворяйся, что у тебя не было вариантов."

#. emotion: With a mix of pleading and urgency
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Don't put me here...please..."
msgstr "Не оставляй меня здесь... пожалуйста..."

#. emotion: In a calm, stern tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't say anything stupid, Nick. No need to go to prison over this."
msgstr "Не говори глупостей, Ник. Не стоит идти в тюрьму из-за этого."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't say anything to Kate"
msgstr "Ничего не говорить Кейт"

#. emotion: Nervously hesitant
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't say nothing, child. You want to thank me? Just take good care of yourself, that's all I want for you."
msgstr "Ничего не говори, дитя. Хочешь отблагодарить меня? Просто береги себя, только этого я для тебя и хочу."

#. emotion: Calmly, with slight annoyance
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Don't say silly things, okay?"
msgstr "Не говори глупостей, ладно?"

#. emotion: In a stern reprimand
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't say such things. You'll invite bad luck."
msgstr "Не говори таких вещей. Навлечёшь неудачу."

#. emotion: Sternly instructing
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Don't say that, Sarah."
msgstr "Не говори так, Сара."

#. emotion: Firmly, with authority
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't say that, dear."
msgstr "Не говори так, дорогая."

#. emotion: Firmly, with authority
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Don't say that."
msgstr "Не говори так."

#. emotion: Firmly, with authority
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't say that."
msgstr "Не говори так."

#. emotion: In a firm, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't say that. We'll need to keep our hopes of if we want any chance of getting out of here."
msgstr "Не говори так. Нам нужно сохранять надежду, если мы хотим выбраться отсюда."

#. emotion: In a caring yet concerned tone
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Don't second guess me girl. You're lucky enough to get a job, given that you have no experience at all."
msgstr "Не перечь мне, девушка. Тебе повезло получить работу, учитывая, что у тебя совсем нет опыта."

#. emotion: Firmly, with caution
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't shake his hand."
msgstr "Не пожимай ему руку."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't speak, open your mouth."
msgstr "Не говори, открой рот."

#. emotion: In a concerned, protective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Don't stand on it, you probably sprained it, Caleb, help her up."
msgstr "Не наступай на неё, похоже на растяжение, Калеб, помоги ей."

#. emotion: In a concerned yet gentle tone
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't stare, dear."
msgstr "Не пялься, дорогая."

#. emotion: In a soft, stern whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't start rumors."
msgstr "Не распускай слухи."

#. emotion: Disinterestedly ignoring
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't start with me."
msgstr "Не начинай."

#. emotion: Disinterestedly ignoring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't start with me."
msgstr "Не начинай."

#. emotion: Angry, impatient shout
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't start with that sir shit, I ain't your daddy. Just do what I tell you."
msgstr "Не начинай это дерьмо с «сэром», я тебе не папочка. Просто делай, что я говорю."

#. emotion: Warily instructing, almost pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't stay here by yourself. If you die, him risking his life will have been for nothing."
msgstr "Не оставайся здесь один. Если ты умрёшь, его риск окажется напрасным."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't stop Kate."
msgstr "Не останавливайся, Кейт."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Don't stop..."
msgstr "Не останавливайся..."

#. emotion: Surprised and intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't stutter, spit it out."
msgstr "Не мямли, выкладывай."

#. emotion: Skeptically intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't suppose you know how to make a campfire?"
msgstr "Неужели ты не умеешь разводить костёр?"

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't take me for a fool. I will not risk my life on your word alone, Tribesman."
msgstr "Не принимай меня за дуру. Я не стану рисковать жизнью, полагаясь только на твоё слово, Племенник."

#. emotion: In a firm, threatening tone
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Don't talk about her like that, or I'll make you regret it."
msgstr "Не говори о ней так, или я заставлю тебя пожалеть."

#. emotion: In a stern, urgent whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't talk about him!"
msgstr "Не говори о нём!"

#. emotion: In a stern, disapproving tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't talk about my family."
msgstr "Не говори о моей семье."

#. emotion: Warily admonishing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't talk like that, Thomas. You're a great king, and we will overcome this."
msgstr "Не говори так, Томас. Ты великий король, и мы преодолеем это."

#. emotion: Disapprovingly stern
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Don't talk like that."
msgstr "Не говори так."

#. emotion: Warily cautioning
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't talk like that. You're going to be alright."
msgstr "Не говори так. Всё будет хорошо."

#. emotion: Calmly pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Don't tell Marion I said that, please."
msgstr "Не говорите Мариону, что я это сказал, пожалуйста."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't tell him"
msgstr "Не говорить ему"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Don't tell him what you were saying"
msgstr "Не рассказывай ему, что ты говорила"

#. emotion: Intrigued and slightly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't tell me girls don't play around here in Bagrad?"
msgstr "Неужели в Баграде девушки не развлекаются?"

#. emotion: Annoyed disbelief
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't tell me that you came here to say you're leaving..."
msgstr "Не говори мне, что пришёл сказать, что уходишь..."

#. emotion: Sarcastically accusing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't tell me they gave you any trouble."
msgstr "Не говори мне, что они доставили тебе хлопот."

#. emotion: Coldly dismissive
msgctxt "speaker:Damian"
msgid "Don't tell me you kidnapped this broad. I don't need that kind of heat on me."
msgstr "Только не говори, что ты похитил эту тёлку. Мне такое внимание ни к чему."

#. emotion: Skeptically questioning
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't tell me you really threatend them?"
msgstr "Не говори мне, что ты действительно угрожала им?"

#. emotion: Annoyed yet firm
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't tell me you're causing me trouble."
msgstr "Не говори мне, что ты создаёшь мне проблемы."

#. emotion: Defensively, with disbelief
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't tell me you're falling for me."
msgstr "Не говори мне, что ты в меня влюбляешься."

#. emotion: Warily interrupting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't tell me you're thinking of stealing that."
msgstr "Не говори мне, что собираешься это украсть."

#. emotion: Suspiciously amused
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Don't tell them of course, before they run wild."
msgstr "Не говори им, конечно, а то они отобьются от рук."

#. emotion: Surprised, mildly disappointed
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Don't thank me yet, princess."
msgstr "Не благодари меня пока, принцесса."

#. emotion: In a tired, resigned whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Don't thank me yet. It's hard work. And you either pick it up quick, or you're out for another."
msgstr "Не благодари пока. Работа тяжёлая. Либо быстро научишься, либо будешь искать другую."

#. emotion: In a calm, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't think about that for now. Just focus on getting better."
msgstr "Не думай об этом сейчас. Просто сосредоточься на выздоровлении."

#. emotion: Surprised revelation
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't think it didn't mean anything to me. Because it did."
msgstr "Не думай, что это ничего для меня не значило. Потому что значило."

#. emotion: Nervously avoiding eye contact
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't think, don't talk, don't do shit to cause trouble, do you understand?"
msgstr "Не думай, не говори, не делай ни хрена, чтобы не создавать проблем, понял?"

#. emotion: Cautiously whispering
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Don't touch it."
msgstr "Не трогай его."

#. emotion: In a stern, cautionary tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't trust anyone that survives for long in a snakepit like court politics, that's my rule for life."
msgstr "Не доверяй никому, кто долго выживает в змеином гнезде придворной политики — таково моё жизненное правило."

#. emotion: In a resigned sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't try anything."
msgstr "Даже не думай."

#. emotion: Warily delivering a stern warning
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Don't try me again, boy, or I'll put you properly on your ass."
msgstr "Не испытывай меня снова, мальчик, или я усажу тебя на задницу как следует."

#. emotion: Contemplatively pondering
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Don't we make the rules?"
msgstr "Разве не мы устанавливаем правила?"

#. emotion: Relievedly assuring, with a hint of admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry Lord Varga, I wish all the nobles could be as timely as yourself."
msgstr "Не волнуйтесь, лорд Варга, хотела бы я, чтобы все дворяне были так же пунктуальны, как вы."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry Nick. It was just a stupid prank the captain played on us."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Ник. Это просто глупая шутка, которую капитан сыграл с нами."

#. emotion: Protectively reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about Kate. I'll keep you safe."
msgstr "Не волнуйся из-за Кейт. Я защищу тебя."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about be, you can go back to your work."
msgstr "Не беспокойся обо мне, можешь возвращаться к своей работе."

#. emotion: Surprised and gently teasing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry about it, blondie."
msgstr "Не за что, блондиночка."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Don't worry about it. I know what it's like to not have a lot. If I can give back a little, I'm always happy to."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом. Я знаю, каково это — иметь мало. Если я могу немного помочь, я всегда рад."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about it. It's fine. I don't mind if you don't mind."
msgstr "Не беспокойся. Всё в порядке. Я не против, если ты не против."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about it. No offense taken."
msgstr "Не беспокойся. Я не обиделась."

#. emotion: In a soft reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't worry about me though."
msgstr "Но обо мне не беспокойся."

#. emotion: Cautiously reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Don't worry about me, I've survived worse. You just make sure to keep yourself safe."
msgstr "Не волнуйся за меня, я переживал и худшее. Ты просто позаботься о своей безопасности."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about me, Mary."
msgstr "Не волнуйся обо мне, Мэри."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Don't worry about me, Sarah. I can take care of myself. I can weave barriers to keep myself safe, and it will only be for a moment."
msgstr "Не волнуйся за меня, Сара. Я могу позаботиться о себе. Я сплету барьеры для защиты, и это будет лишь на мгновение."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't worry about me."
msgstr "Не волнуйся обо мне."

#. emotion: In a soothing, gentle tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about that for now. Just be happy that you were able to break out of it."
msgstr "Не думай об этом сейчас. Просто радуйся, что тебе удалось вырваться из этого."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about that, Samayra. It's not about work."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом, Самайра. Дело не в работе."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring, with gentle firmness
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Don't worry about that."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring, with gentle firmness
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about that."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring, with gentle firmness
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't worry about that."
msgstr "Не беспокойся об этом."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry blondie, I can tell you're new to this, unlike your friend. I'll go real easy on you."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, блондиночка, я вижу, ты новичок в этом, в отличие от подруги. Я буду с тобой очень нежен."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry blondie. I like that about you. Pure heart, taking pity on a stray dog."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, блонди. Мне это в тебе нравится. Чистое сердце, жалеешь бездомную собаку."

#. emotion: Reassuringly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry blondie. You're better at it than I was at your age."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, блонди. У тебя получается лучше, чем у меня в твоём возрасте."

#. emotion: In a gentle, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Ragged Man"
msgid "Don't worry child. What is carved in, can be carved out."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, дитя. Что вырезано, то можно и вырезать."

#. emotion: Comfortingly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't worry dear."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, дорогая."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Don't worry girl."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, девочка."

#. emotion: Warmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry yourself about me. You look like a mess."
msgstr "Не беспокойся обо мне. Сама-то выглядишь ужасно."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry, Blondie."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Блонди."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, Brother. I cannot imagine she will try to harm me."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, брат. Не могу представить, чтобы она попыталась причинить мне вред."

#. emotion: In a comforting, assuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Caleb"
msgid "Don't worry, Ephraim knows a thing or two about this sort of stuff. He's not a doctor, but on the battlefield, he's as good as you're gonna get."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Эфраим кое-что в этом понимает. Он не врач, но на поле боя он лучший, кого можно найти."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, I barely go anywhere these days without my guards. They're right outside."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я в последнее время почти никуда не хожу без стражи. Они прямо снаружи."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't worry, I can make it."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я разведу."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring, with empathy
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Don't worry, I don't much care for rules like that. You can keep it if you like. They're not really dangerous."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, мне не очень важны такие правила. Можешь оставить его, если хочешь. Они не опасны."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't worry, I got a few ideas."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, у меня есть пара идей."

#. emotion: Reassuringly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Don't worry, I have enough experience for the both of us."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, у меня достаточно опыта на нас двоих."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Don't worry, I will be gentle."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я буду нежна."

#. emotion: Reassuringly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Don't worry, I'd never let anything happen to you, alright?"
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я никогда не позволю чему-либо случиться с тобой, хорошо?"

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll help you finish."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я помогу тебе кончить."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll just pull out and get the key and let Nick here have a go..."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я просто вытащу и возьму ключ, и позволю Нику попробовать..."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't worry, I'll show you."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, я покажу тебе."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, Jaeid. Smiling and pretending like everything is fine is what I was taught to do from birth."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Джаид. Улыбаться и притворяться, что всё в порядке — меня учили этому с рождения."

#. emotion: Reassuringly, with calm assurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, Marius."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Мариус."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, Samayra."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Самайра."

#. emotion: Reassuringly, with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't worry, Sarah."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Сара."

#. emotion: Reassuringly, with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Don't worry, Sarah."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Сара."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Don't worry, Sarah. Like I said, it happens in transmogrification."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Сара. Как я и сказал, такое случается при трансфигурации."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't worry, Sarah. Only teasing. My bark is worse than my bite."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, Сара. Просто дразню. Мой лай хуже, чем укус."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Don't worry, Sophia, without you this place would be a bore."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, София, без тебя это место было бы скучным."

#. emotion: Relieved, comforting
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't worry, dear."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, дорогая."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Don't worry, dear. I will teach you how you were supposed to be taught."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, дорогая. Я научу тебя так, как тебя должны были научить."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Albert"
msgid "Don't worry, girl."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, девочка."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Tailor"
msgid "Don't worry, girl. You ain't got anything I haven't seen a thousand times before."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, девонька. У тебя нет ничего такого, чего бы я не видел тысячу раз."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Don't worry, he wants me to come see him."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, он хочет, чтобы я подошла к нему."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Jasmine"
msgid "Don't worry, he was like that with me too when I first came here."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, он таким же был со мной, когда я впервые сюда попала."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't worry, he's not gonna jump."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, он не собирается прыгать."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Don't worry, it gets easier."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, со временем станет легче."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't worry, it's easy. Yours are the underwear with all the flowers on em."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, это просто. Твоё бельё — то, что всё в цветочках."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring with confidence
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Don't worry, it's not an accusation, simply a statement of fact. I know that you did."
msgstr "Не волнуйтесь, это не обвинение, просто констатация факта. Я знаю, что вы это сделали."

#. emotion: In a playful teasing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't worry, just teasing. Like I said, I'm just looking for someone to share a drink with, nothin more."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, просто дразню. Как я и сказал, я просто ищу компанию для выпивки, не более."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring, with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Don't worry, lady Sarah."
msgstr "Не волнуйтесь, леди Сара."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Don't worry, lady Sarah. Your husband is as skilled a swordsmen as any."
msgstr "Не волнуйтесь, леди Сара. Ваш муж — такой же искусный мечник, как и любой другой."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, you'll be alright."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, всё будет хорошо."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't worry, you'll get your gold."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, ты получишь своё золото."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, you're here under my protection. Nobody will bother you."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, ты здесь под моей защитой. Никто тебя не тронет."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Don't worry, you're not the first to say that."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, ты не первая, кто это говорит."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "Don't worry, you're not the only girl to have that reaction."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, ты не единственная девушка, которая так реагирует."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry, you're safe."
msgstr "Не волнуйся, ты в безопасности."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Serenely reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry."
msgstr "Не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Assuringly comforting
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Don't worry. He will understand and he will respect your wishes. You will still have value to him, even without your body."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Он поймёт и уважит твои желания. Ты всё ещё будешь ценна для него, даже без твоего тела."

#. emotion: Comfortingly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't worry. I got you."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Я держу тебя."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry. I promise it won't hurt."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Обещаю, не будет больно."

#. emotion: In a comforting, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't worry. I told you I wanted to fuck your brains out, and that's exactly what I did."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Я сказала, что хочу вытрахать из тебя весь мозг, и именно это сделала."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Don't worry. I'd rather die swinging my sword than let them hurt you."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Я лучше умру с мечом в руке, чем позволю им причинить тебе боль."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Don't worry. It wasn't your fault, was it?"
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Это ведь не твоя вина, правда?"

#. emotion: Warmly, with reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Don't worry. It will be okay. I survived it too."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Всё будет хорошо. Я тоже через это прошла."

#. emotion: In a calming, reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry. It's been many years, I've managed to move on."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Прошло много лет, я смогла двигаться дальше."

#. emotion: Patiently consoling
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry. It's the least I can do for what you've given me."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Это меньшее, что я могу сделать в ответ на то, что ты мне дал."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Don't worry. Keep to yourself and everyone will treat you just fine."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Будешь держаться своей — и все будут относиться к тебе нормально."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Don't worry. The Khan holds no secrets from us. He told me about your evening in the garden."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. У хана нет секретов от нас. Он рассказал мне о вашем вечере в саду."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "Don't worry. There isn't any time."
msgstr "Не волнуйтесь. Времени нет."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't worry. Usin the whip on a beauty like you would be an awful waste."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Хлестать плёткой такую красавицу, как ты, было бы ужасной тратой."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Don't worry. You have your father's blood."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. В тебе течёт кровь твоего отца."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry. You're safe with me. I promise nothing will happen to you."
msgstr "Не волнуйся. Ты в безопасности со мной. Я обещаю, с тобой ничего не случится."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't you agree?"
msgstr "Разве ты не согласна?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't you feel bad about killing them?"
msgstr "Тебе не жаль, что ты их убил?"

#. emotion: Sarcastically amused
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't you go apologizin now, blondie."
msgstr "Не вздумай извиняться, блонди."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Don't you got to say goodbye to wherever it is you stayin?"
