msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Эй!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Эй!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Эй!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Scholar"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Эй!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Soldier"
msgid "Hey!"
msgstr "Эй!"

#. emotion: Surprised and excited
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey! Blondie, don't be sleepin on the job!"
msgstr "Эй! Блондинка, не спать на работе!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! Calm down!"
msgstr "Эй! Успокойся!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Hey! Don't they teach you it's rude to answer questions with questions in Rosanna?"
msgstr "Эй! Разве в Розанне не учат, что отвечать вопросом на вопрос невежливо?"

#. emotion: Surprised exclamation
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Hey! I don't do that!"
msgstr "Эй! Я так не делаю!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Hey! I have feelings too you know."
msgstr "Эй! У меня тоже есть чувства, знаешь ли."

#. emotion: Intrigued by the unexpectedness
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey! I win...sometimes."
msgstr "Эй! Я выигрываю... иногда."

#. emotion: Excitedly pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! I...I need that to clean up the house!"
msgstr "Эй! Мне... мне нужно это, чтобы убрать в доме!"

#. emotion: Urgently pleading, with desperation
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! Let me go!"
msgstr "Эй! Отпусти меня!"

#. emotion: Confidently confident
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey! Listen to me, if you think that-"
msgstr "Эй! Слушай сюда, если ты думаешь, что-"

#. emotion: Playfully challenging
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Hey! No need to fight us, we're just here to celebrate her Highness!"
msgstr "Эй! Не нужно драться с нами, мы здесь, чтобы почтить её Высочество!"

#. emotion: In a soft apologetic tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! Ooh, and Ephraim, please don't call me that. I'm really not anything special."
msgstr "Привет! Ой, Эфраим, пожалуйста, не называй меня так. Я действительно не представляю собой ничего особенного."

#. emotion: Surprised alert
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey! Samayra! Wait up!"
msgstr "Эй! Самайра! Подожди!"

#. emotion: In a frantic, urgent outburst
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Hey! Stop that! Leave the princess alone!"
msgstr "Эй! Прекратите! Оставьте принцессу в покое!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! That's my breakfast! Go make your own!"
msgstr "Эй! Это мой завтрак! Иди приготовь свой!"

#. emotion: Confused amusement
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey! That's not funny."
msgstr "Эй! Это не смешно."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! The story isn't done yet."
msgstr "Эй! История ещё не закончена."

#. emotion: Surprised, curious
msgctxt "speaker:Other man"
msgid "Hey! Wadda bout me?"
msgstr "Эй! А как же я?"

#. emotion: Urgently pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! Watch it!"
msgstr "Эй! Полегче!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hey! Watch it, I'm delicate."
msgstr "Эй! Поаккуратнее, я нежная."

#. emotion: In a casual, friendly tone
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey! Watch it."
msgstr "Эй! Полегче."

#. emotion: Surprised, reassured whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! We're not gonna hurt you!"
msgstr "Эй! Мы не причиним тебе вреда!"

#. emotion: Excitedly surprised
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! What are you doing!"
msgstr "Эй! Что ты делаешь!"

#. emotion: Energetically surprised
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! What are you doing?!"
msgstr "Эй! Что ты делаешь?!"

#. emotion: Surprised and incredulous
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey! You can't just-"
msgstr "Эй! Ты не можешь просто-"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey, Blondie."
msgstr "Эй, Блонди."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, Hecate, good to see you again."
msgstr "Привет, Геката, рада снова тебя видеть."

#. emotion: Excitedly, with anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Caleb"
msgid "Hey, I asked you a question!"
msgstr "Эй, я задал тебе вопрос!"

#. emotion: Warily reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, I know this is a lot right now, but I promise you, you're safe here. I'll keep you safe."
msgstr "Эй, я знаю, сейчас это всё слишком, но я обещаю тебе, ты в безопасности. Я позабочусь о тебе."

#. emotion: Confidently assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey, I never said I wouldn't make it worth her time."
msgstr "Эй, я не говорила, что она уйдёт ни с чем."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey, I won't pass up on a show."
msgstr "Эй, я не откажусь от зрелища."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Hey, I'm Nick."
msgstr "Привет, я Ник."

#. emotion: Casually inviting
msgctxt "speaker:Gabriel"
msgid "Hey, I'm just saying."
msgstr "Эй, я просто говорю."

#. emotion: Warily greeting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, Jacob!"
msgstr "Эй, Джейкоб!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, Samayra, check this out."
msgstr "Эй, Самайра, смотри сюда."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Hey, Sarah!"
msgstr "Привет, Сара!"

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hey, Sarah!"
msgstr "Привет, Сара!"

#. emotion: Inquisitively questioning
msgctxt "speaker:Male Soldier"
msgid "Hey, answer me."
msgstr "Эй, ответь мне."

#. emotion: Warily curious
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey, blondie. You all settled in?"
msgstr "Эй, блондиночка. Устроилась?"

#. emotion: Energetically excited
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey, boy! Get over here!"
msgstr "Эй, парень! Иди сюда!"

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, calm down now. You're gonna need that energy if you wanna keep up with me."
msgstr "Эй, успокойся. Эта энергия понадобится тебе, чтобы поспевать за мной."

#. emotion: Warily consoling
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey, don't cry."
msgstr "Эй, не плачь."

#. emotion: In a concerned yet reassuring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Hey, don't go making promises to your mom that you can't keep."
msgstr "Эй, не давай маме обещаний, которые не сможешь сдержать."

#. emotion: Affectionately reassured
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, don't let Kate get to you. She's a lot nicer than she pretends to be."
msgstr "Эй, не позволяй Кейт тебя смущать. Она намного добрее, чем притворяется."

#. emotion: Reassuringly, with calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Hey, don't worry."
msgstr "Эй, не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Affectionately reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, don't worry. We will. I promise."
msgstr "Эй, не волнуйся. Мы поговорим. Обещаю."

#. emotion: Whispering gently, anxiously
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, easy."
msgstr "Эй, тише."

#. emotion: Intrigued curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey, girlie. Over here."
msgstr "Эй, красотка. Сюда."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey, hang on a moment."
msgstr "Эй, погоди-ка."

#. emotion: Casually amused
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey, hang on."
msgstr "Эй, погоди."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey, help me out will you? This strap is always a real pain."
msgstr "Эй, поможешь? Этот ремень всегда такая морока."

#. emotion: Nervously amused
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, hold up."
msgstr "Эй, погоди."

#. emotion: Calmly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Lily"
msgid "Hey, if you're gonna act like a-"
msgstr "Эй, если ты собираешься вести себя как —"

#. emotion: Confused and concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey, isn't that your slave? Samayra, was it?"
msgstr "Эй, это не твоя рабыня? Самайра, кажется?"

#. emotion: Softly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Hey, it will be ok. We'll just wait for Kate to come back, and we can sort it all out."
msgstr "Эй, всё будет хорошо. Мы просто подождём, пока Кейт вернётся, и всё уладим."

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, it's just you and me. And it's my desk, and I'm telling you it's fine, okay?"
msgstr "Эй, здесь только ты и я. И это мой стол, и я говорю тебе, что всё в порядке, хорошо?"

#. emotion: Calm reassurance
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, it's ok, we're safe, don't worry."
msgstr "Эй, всё хорошо, мы в безопасности, не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey, just returning the question."
msgstr "Эй, я просто возвращаю вопрос."

#. emotion: With a sense of nostalgia and gentle teasing
msgctxt "speaker:Nathan"
msgid "Hey, keep it down, remember?"
msgstr "Эй, потише, помнишь?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, let's get back inside."
msgstr "Эй, давай вернёмся внутрь."

#. emotion: Playfully mocking
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, remember, appearances!"
msgstr "Эй, помни, для вида!"

#. emotion: In a frustrated, urgent tone
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Hey, stop day dreaming!"
msgstr "Эй, хватит мечтать!"

#. emotion: In a calm, soothing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Hey, take a moment. Breathe. Come on."
msgstr "Эй, передохни. Дыши. Давай."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, time to wake up."
msgstr "Эй, пора вставать."

#. emotion: Casually encouraging
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey, wake up."
msgstr "Эй, просыпайся."

#. emotion: Cheerfully encouraging
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey, watch it!"
msgstr "Эй, полегче!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Hey, what you find, huh?"
msgstr "Эй, чё ты там нашёл, а?"

#. emotion: Surprised disbelief
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey, you don't believe me, right? And Captain Belmont only drinks with friends."
msgstr "Эй, ты мне не веришь, да? А капитан Бельмонт пьёт только с друзьями."

#. emotion: Intrigued, contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Hey, you never know. Who knows how the world works out."
msgstr "Эй, никогда не знаешь. Кто знает, как всё обернётся в этом мире."

#. emotion: In a surprised, bewildered whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sophia"
msgid "Hey, you scared me."
msgstr "Эй, ты меня напугала."

#. emotion: Anxiously curious
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey, you're the big chief now. Everyone is going to be out for your head."
msgstr "Эй, ты теперь главная шишка. Все будут охотиться за твоей головой."

#. emotion: Casually surprised
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Hey, your end of the bargain first, Blondie."
msgstr "Эй, сначала твоя часть сделки, Блонди."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey."
msgstr "Эй."

#. emotion: Casually inquisitive
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey. Are your men ready?"
msgstr "Эй. Твои люди готовы?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey. Did you get any good sleep?"
msgstr "Эй. Ты хорошо выспалась?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey. Thought I missed you out here."
msgstr "Эй. Думала, ты где-то здесь."

#. emotion: In a concerned yet hesitant whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr "Эй..."

#. emotion: In a concerned yet hesitant whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr "Эй..."

#. emotion: In a concerned yet hesitant whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey..."
msgstr "Эй..."

#. emotion: In an excited tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey...I just came back from getting some water."
msgstr "Эй... я только что ходила за водой."

#. emotion: Softly pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hey...don't be greedy, that's my gift."
msgstr "Эй... не жадничай, это мой подарок."

#. emotion: Suspiciously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hey? What's wrong, you don't like it?"
msgstr "Эй? Что случилось, тебе не нравится?"

#. emotion: Welcomingly, with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Hi Sarah, I hope you had a good night sleep."
msgstr "Привет, Сара. Надеюсь, ты хорошо выспалась."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Hi! Are you a friend of Sarah's too?"
msgstr "Привет! Ты тоже подруга Сары?"

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hi."
msgstr "Привет."

#. emotion: Reflective disappointment
msgctxt "speaker:Razaphel"
msgid "Hidden away, they could not affect the world. Instead, they drafted the very story of their own return."
msgstr "Укрывшись, они не могли влиять на мир. Вместо этого они написали саму историю своего возвращения."

#. emotion: Cautiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hidden behind a series of crates, there was a small gap in the pallisade walls."
msgstr "Спрятанный за ящиками, в частоколе был небольшой проём."

#. emotion: In a somber, reflective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hidden behind the mask, she somehow felt more safe, despite all the rest of her entirely exposed."
msgstr "Скрытая за маской, она почему-то чувствовала себя в большей безопасности, несмотря на то, что всё остальное было полностью обнажено."

#. emotion: Tense with anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hidden here, among the ruins, sheltered from the world."
msgstr "Скрытое здесь, среди руин, укрытое от мира."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Hide"
msgstr "Спрятаться"

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Hide UI"
msgstr "Скрыть интерфейс"

#. emotion: Disappointedly, with a sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hide out a few days, weeks...let it cool down, and you're good as new."
msgstr "Отсидеться несколько дней, недель... дать всему утихнуть — и ты как новенький."

msgctxt "ui"
msgid "Hides the user interface."
msgstr "Скрывает интерфейс."

#. emotion: Reflectively skeptical
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hiding and sneaking around was pointless and soon abandoned. By the end, Sarah and Sakar vanished into the bushes with few doubts as to their intentions."
msgstr "Прятаться и красться было бессмысленно, и от этого быстро отказались. В конце концов Сара и Сакар исчезали в кустах, и в их намерениях мало кто сомневался."

#. emotion: Softly admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hiding behind her father, she had greeted the man who had a kind smile and a strange confident grace about him."
msgstr "Прячась за спиной отца, она поприветствовала мужчину с доброй улыбкой и странной уверенной грацией."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hiding behind some stacked boxes, Kate turned to Sarah."
msgstr "Спрятавшись за штабелями ящиков, Кейт повернулась к Саре."

#. emotion: In a flat, uninterested tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hiding poorly."
msgstr "Пряталась плохо."

#. emotion: Surprised realization
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hiding the orgasm from Belmont was barely even an idea in her mind, much less something she could even manage in this state."
msgstr "Мысль скрыть оргазм от Белмонта едва ли приходила ей в голову, не говоря уже о том, чтобы попытаться сделать это в таком состоянии."

#. emotion: Admiring respectfulness
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "High General Barion is an army man, so he loves to imagine every enemy an existential threat to our nation. It makes him feel needed."
msgstr "Верховный генерал Барион — военный человек, поэтому он любит воображать каждого врага смертельной угрозой. Это заставляет его чувствовать себя нужным."

#. emotion: Warily respectful
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "High King of the Union."
msgstr "Верховный Король Союза."

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "High Priest"
msgstr "Верховный жрец"

#. emotion: Nodding respectfully
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "High Queen of the Union."
msgstr "Верховная Королева Союза."

#. emotion: Warily acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Hassar"
msgid "High-General Kamal!"
msgstr "Верховный генерал Камал!"

#. emotion: In awe and admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Marshal Edmond"
msgid "High-General of the Union."
msgstr "Верховный Генерал Союза."

#. emotion: Calmly reflecting with a hint of resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "Higher than I can earn, really. Well, I guess I shouldn't be too surprised...they were criminals after all."
msgstr "Выше, чем я могу заработать, на самом деле. Ну, я думаю, мне не стоит удивляться... они ведь были преступниками."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Higher up on the plateaus, the design of the buildings seemed to become more intricate."
msgstr "Выше на плато архитектура зданий становилась более изысканной."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Him and his wife Emma run a moderately succesful alchemy story up one of the streets near the market district."
msgstr "Он и его жена Эмма управляют довольно успешной алхимической лавкой на одной из улиц рядом с рыночным районом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Him, a male with an urge to release, she an available female."
msgstr "Он — самец с желанием разрядки, она — доступная самка."

#. emotion: In a somber, mournful tone
msgctxt "speaker:Tribesman"
msgid "Him, his sisters, and thousands of others. They were conquered. A defeated people must suffer their defeat."
msgstr "Его, его сестёр и тысячи других. Они были завоёваны. Побеждённый народ должен страдать от своего поражения."

#. emotion: Detached curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Him. Some random man from another room...none of it made any difference now."
msgstr "Он. Какой-то случайный мужчина из другой комнаты... теперь это уже не имело значения."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hints of grey in his beard spoke to his old age, as did his battle wounds, though Sarah had no idea how old orcs could get."
msgstr "Проблески седины в его бороде говорили о его возрасте, как и боевые раны, хотя Сара понятия не имела, сколько живут орки."

#. emotion: Confused curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Hints? What does that mean, exactly?"
msgstr "Намёки? Что это значит, конкретно?"

#. emotion: Motivatingly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "His Legions will secure your victory, remember that."
msgstr "Его Легионы обеспечат твою победу, помни об этом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His Tribal speak was entirely foreign to Sarah. She could make no sense of it. But to the men, it appeared to stir something."
msgstr "Его речь на языке Племён была совершенно чужой для Сары. Она не понимала ни слова. Но на мужчин это, казалось, подействовало."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His age was undeniable, but as he slipped out from his pants, his cock sprang out."
msgstr "Его возраст был очевиден, но когда он выскользнул из штанов, его член выскочил наружу."

#. emotion: In a somber, reflective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His already weakend and womanly moaning transformed completely to one of submission."
msgstr "Его и без того слабые и женственные стоны полностью превратились в стоны подчинения."

#. emotion: Relieved, with fondness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His anger towards her subsided, and the two found some semblance of love between them."
msgstr "Его гнев на неё утих, и они нашли некоторое подобие любви друг к другу."

#. emotion: Softly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His answer came like a whisper, but all had heard it."
msgstr "Его ответ прозвучал как шёпот, но все его услышали."

#. emotion: Flatly acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His answer never came."
msgstr "Он так и не ответил."

#. emotion: Firmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His answer was swift and definitive."
msgstr "Его ответ был быстрым и решительным."

#. emotion: Surprised yet apologetic
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His apology came quickly, as he was still inside of her."
msgstr "Его извинения последовали быстро, пока он всё ещё был внутри неё."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His appearance matched his personality, strong and firm, he had managed to grow old without the frailties of age."
msgstr "Его внешность соответствовала его характеру — сильный и твёрдый, он умудрился состариться без старческой немощи."

#. emotion: Sternly demanding
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His appetite is first singular, demanding the women to continue performing oral sex on him."
msgstr "Сначала его аппетит скромен: он требует от женщин продолжать делать ему минет."

#. emotion: Suspiciously curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His arm had not completed the full arc before the spirit latched onto it."
msgstr "Его рука не успела завершить полную дугу, как дух вцепился в неё."

#. emotion: With excited intensity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His arm released like a cannon, his blade swinging with incredible strength and speed."
