msgstr "Моя семья ведёт свой род веками. Тысячелетиями."

#. emotion: In a warm, welcoming tone
msgctxt "speaker:Shah Mahda"
msgid "My family has always been loyal allies to your order. We shall receive you and your apprentice with all the hospitalities that are due."
