msgid "Samayra flashed an impish smile."
msgstr "Самайра озорно улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Sarcastically mocking
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra flopped her hand limpy around in the air, her best imitation of an flaccid penis."
msgstr "Самайра безвольно помахала рукой в воздухе — лучшее подражание вялому пенису."

#. emotion: In a weary but hopeful tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra for her part, had fought hard enough to survive yet one more day."
msgstr "Самайра, со своей стороны, боролась достаточно отчаянно, чтобы прожить ещё один день."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra frowned."
msgstr "Самайра нахмурилась."

#. emotion: Radiantly proud
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra gave a wide smile."
msgstr "Самайра широко улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra gestured towards the window."
msgstr "Самайра указала на окно."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra got up and extended her hand."
msgstr "Самайра встала и протянула руку."

#. emotion: Tenderly holding tightly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra grabbed Sarah's hand and began to guide her again."
msgstr "Самайра схватила Сару за руку и снова повела её."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra grabbed her cup and downed it entirely."
msgstr "Самайра схватила свою кружку и осушила её до дна."

#. emotion: Playfully amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra grinned."
msgstr "Самайра усмехнулась."

#. emotion: In a concerned, caring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had a bit to drink, but Sarah could see it hadn't been so much as to make this wrong."
msgstr "Самайра немного выпила, но Сара видела, что недостаточно, чтобы это было неправильно."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had a wide smile on her face."
msgstr "На лице Самайры расплылась широкая улыбка."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had already rushed for the door before Sarah was well and ready."
msgstr "Самайра уже бросилась к двери, прежде чем Сара успела собраться."

#. emotion: Contentedly reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had been one of the rare few friends in an otherwise lonely house."
msgstr "Самайра была одной из немногих подруг в этом одиноком доме."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had by now become herself, if not more than herself."
msgstr "Самайра к тому времени уже пришла в себя, если не стала лучше прежней."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had gotten up surprisingly early."
msgstr "Самайра проснулась на удивление рано."

#. emotion: In a detached, reflective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had little strength in her arms, but here in the water, this was little concern."
msgstr "У Самайры было мало силы в руках, но здесь, в воде, это было неважно."

#. emotion: Contemplatively reflecting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had lived even more isolated than Sarah had when growing up, so it was no surprise that it impressed her."
msgstr "Самайра жила ещё более изолированно, чем Сара в детстве, так что неудивительно, что город поразил её."

#. emotion: In a tired, contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had taken the last watch and was still awake."
msgstr "Самайра взяла последнюю вахту и всё ещё не спала."

#. emotion: Eagerly anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra had taken to her new role as Sarah's secretary with great zeal."
msgstr "Самайра с большим рвением взялась за свою новую роль секретаря Сары."

#. emotion: Neutrally admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra helped as well, though her magics were far weaker than either of the other two."
msgstr "Самайра тоже помогала, хотя её магия была гораздо слабее, чем у обеих других."

#. emotion: Calmly repeating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra in turn did the same."
msgstr "Самайра в свою очередь сделала то же самое."

#. emotion: In a surprised, bewildered manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra interupted Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра прервала Сару."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra is surprised at first, but does not break her performance."
msgstr "Самайра сначала удивлена, но не прекращает своего танца."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra is the first walk away, grabbing Sarah's hands and pulling her along."
msgstr "Самайра первой отходит, хватая Сару за руку и увлекая за собой."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra joined her."
msgstr "Самайра присоединилась к ней."

#. emotion: Anxiously panicked
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra jumped back into the center of the room."
msgstr "Самайра отпрыгнула в центр комнаты."

#. emotion: Surprisingly elated
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra jumped up into the air, punching with one fist."
msgstr "Самайра подпрыгнула в воздух, взмахнув кулаком."

#. emotion: Softly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra just smiled."
msgstr "Самайра просто улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra kept her eyes fixed to the floor."
msgstr "Самайра не отрывала взгляда от пола."

#. emotion: In a tender, affectionate manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra kissed her again."
msgstr "Самайра снова поцеловала её."

#. emotion: Giggling with delight
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra laughed, a wide grin."
msgstr "Самайра рассмеялась, широко улыбаясь."

#. emotion: Playfully chuckling
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra laughed."
msgstr "Самайра рассмеялась."

#. emotion: In a contemplative, almost dreamy tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra launched a flurry of snowballs, one after the other."
msgstr "Самайра запустила град снежков, один за другим."

#. emotion: Casually humming
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leaned back, still smiling at her."
msgstr "Самайра откинулась назад, всё ещё улыбаясь ей."

#. emotion: Tenderly longing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leaned down and kissed her again."
msgstr "Самайра наклонилась и снова поцеловала её."

#. emotion: Delightfully surprised, with admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leaned forward and grabbed her shoulder."
msgstr "Самайра подалась вперёд и схватила её за плечо."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leaned forward and softly kissed Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра подалась вперёд и нежно поцеловала Сару."

#. emotion: In a warm, affectionate manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leaned in close to Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра наклонилась к Саре."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leaned on her shoulder."
msgstr "Самайра прильнула к её плечу."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leapt forward and threw her arms around Sarah, hugging her tightly."
msgstr "Самайра подалась вперёд и обхватила Сару руками, крепко обнимая её."

#. emotion: Eagerly anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra leapt up to her feet and frantically began throwing off her clothes."
msgstr "Самайра вскочила на ноги и лихорадочно начала сбрасывать одежду."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked across the small room."
msgstr "Самайра оглядела маленькую комнату."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked around the room as she began to slowly swim, almost float, through the water."
msgstr "Самайра оглядела комнату, медленно плывя, почти паря в воде."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at Alaric and smiled."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на Аларика и улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at Sarah with her huge eyes, a wide grin on her face."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на Сару своими огромными глазами, с широкой улыбкой на лице."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at Sarah with one raised eyebrow."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на Сару, приподняв бровь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at her confused."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на неё в замешательстве."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at her, a wide smile on her face."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на неё с широкой улыбкой на лице."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at her, still brushing her hair."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на неё, всё ещё расчёсывая волосы."

#. emotion: Anxiously apprehensive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at the ground, scared to meet Sarah's gaze."
msgstr "Самайра смотрела в землю, боясь встретиться взглядом с Сарой."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked at the soldiers behind her."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на солдат позади себя."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked like a child, caught by a strict parent."
msgstr "Самайра выглядела как ребёнок, застигнутый строгим родителем."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked off to the far side of the room, avoiding any eye contact."
msgstr "Самайра смотрела в дальнюю сторону комнаты, избегая зрительного контакта."

#. emotion: Reflectively attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked out across the horizon, taking in the endless ocean of snow."
msgstr "Самайра посмотрела на горизонт, впитывая бескрайний океан снега."

#. emotion: In a reflective, thoughtful manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked up from the desk."
msgstr "Самайра оторвала взгляд от стола."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looked up."
msgstr "Самайра подняла взгляд."

#. emotion: In awe, slightly bewildered
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra looks around, dazed."
msgstr "Самайра оглядывается, ошеломлённая."

#. emotion: Casually strolling
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra made her way towards the table."
msgstr "Самайра направилась к столу."

#. emotion: Suspiciously wary
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra moaned as Sarah began to push her fingers deeper into her."
msgstr "Самайра застонала, когда Сара начала погружать пальцы глубже."

#. emotion: Softly, with sorrow
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra moaned the words between heavy breaths."
msgstr "Самайра простонала слова между тяжёлыми вздохами."

#. emotion: In a resigned sorrowful whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra moaned, increasingly louder, but all her cries were lost to the ruins and the wilderness."
msgstr "Самайра стонала всё громче, но все её крики терялись среди руин и дикой природы."

#. emotion: Cautiously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra moved her hand, the flame following along."
msgstr "Самайра пошевелила рукой, и пламя последовало за ней."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra never broke her hug."
msgstr "Самайра не разрывала объятий."

#. emotion: Casually confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded and began to follow Sarah as they walked towards her room."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула и пошла за Сарой в её комнату."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded and began to set up camp."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула и начала разбивать лагерь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded and continued to pull Sarah along."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула и продолжила тащить Сару за собой."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded as she listened to Sarah explain."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, слушая объяснения Сары."

#. emotion: Enthusiastically clapping
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded enthusiastically."
msgstr "Самайра восторженно кивнула."

#. emotion: With warm, respectful admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded solemnly."
msgstr "Самайра торжественно кивнула."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, and remained close."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула и осталась рядом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, but still seemed uncertain."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, но всё ещё выглядела неуверенной."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, following Sarah's lead."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, следуя за Сарой."

#. emotion: Nervously attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, never taking her eyes of the books."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, не сводя глаз с книг."

#. emotion: Tenderly with admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, now smiling."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, теперь улыбаясь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, smiling."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, улыбаясь."

#. emotion: Quietly contented
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, turned, and left."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, развернулась и вышла."

#. emotion: In a tense, fearful whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded, wordlessly, the fear in her heart played out on her voice."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула, безмолвно, страх в её сердце отразился в голосе."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra nodded. The question seemed to turn her somber again."
msgstr "Самайра кивнула. Вопрос, казалось, снова омрачил её."

#. emotion: Calmly accepting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra offered no resistance."
msgstr "Самайра не сопротивлялась."

#. emotion: Softly chuckling
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra only laughed."
msgstr "Самайра лишь рассмеялась."

#. emotion: Warily admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra only looked up, a deep gratitude in her face."
msgstr "Самайра только подняла взгляд, с глубокой благодарностью на лице."

#. emotion: Casually acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra only nodded in response."
msgstr "Самайра лишь кивнула в ответ."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra only nodded, absently."
msgstr "Самайра лишь рассеянно кивнула."

#. emotion: Reflective hesitation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra only produced a noise of uncertainty, still too dazed to say a word."
msgstr "Самайра издала лишь неопределённый звук, всё ещё слишком ошеломлённая, чтобы произнести хоть слово."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra opened the door further and stepped into the small room."
msgstr "Самайра открыла дверь шире и вошла в маленькую комнату."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra patted the bed."
msgstr "Самайра похлопала по кровати."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra paused."
msgstr "Самайра замолчала."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra peaked her head through the door."
msgstr "Самайра просунула голову в дверь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra pointed at a group of men nearby, sitting in the shade."
msgstr "Самайра указала на группу мужчин неподалёку, сидящих в тени."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra pointed at another figure on the painting."
msgstr "Самайра указала на другую фигуру на картине."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra pointed at the painting."
msgstr "Самайра указала на картину."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra pointed towards one of the side streets."
msgstr "Самайра указала на одну из боковых улиц."

#. emotion: Calmly, with contemplation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra pouted."
msgstr "Самайра надула губы."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra pulled away."
msgstr "Самайра отстранилась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra quickly crossed the distance between them, following closely behind Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра быстро преодолела разделявшее их расстояние, следуя за Сарой."

#. emotion: Confidently and with resilience
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra quickly got over the insult."
msgstr "Самайра быстро пережила оскорбление."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra quickly got up and crawled into bed with Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра быстро встала и забралась в кровать к Саре."

#. emotion: Tenderly embracing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra reaches out and holds onto Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра протягивает руку и хватается за Сару."

#. emotion: Delightfully surprised
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra returned the compliment."
msgstr "Самайра вернула комплимент."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra rolled her eyes."
msgstr "Самайра закатила глаза."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra rushed up to the edge of the dance floor, but rather than return, she began to wave."
msgstr "Самайра подбежала к краю танцпола, но вместо того чтобы вернуться, начала махать."

#. emotion: Reflectively thoughtful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra saluted."
msgstr "Самайра отдала честь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat down at the table next to Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра села за стол рядом с Сарой."

#. emotion: Nervously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat down on her other side."
msgstr "Самайра села с другой стороны."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat down on the bench and motioned for Sarah to join her, which she did."
msgstr "Самайра села на скамейку и жестом пригласила Сару присоединиться, что та и сделала."

#. emotion: Tentatively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat down on the edge of the bed before looking at Sarah properly."
msgstr "Самайра села на край кровати, прежде чем как следует взглянуть на Сару."

#. emotion: Nodding attentively
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat down opposite of her."
msgstr "Самайра села напротив."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat next to her, nearly close enough to sit shoulder to shoulder."
msgstr "Самайра села рядом, почти плечом к плечу."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sat next to her."
msgstr "Самайра сидела рядом с ней."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra scowled at her, but Sarah struggled to ever take the girl's anger very seriously."
msgstr "Самайра нахмурилась, но Саре с трудом удавалось воспринимать гнев этой девушки всерьёз."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra scratched her own chin."
msgstr "Самайра почесала подбородок."

#. emotion: In a subdued, somber tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra seemed dissapointed at Sarah's reply."
msgstr "Самайра, казалось, была разочарована ответом Сары."

#. emotion: Slightly disappointed glint in her eye
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra seemed dissapointed."
msgstr "Самайра выглядела разочарованной."

#. emotion: Surprised and bewildered
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra seemed shocked and confused."
msgstr "Самайра выглядела шокированной и сбитой с толку."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra shook her head again."
msgstr "Самайра снова покачала головой."

#. emotion: Casually dismissive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra shook her head."
msgstr "Самайра покачала головой."

#. emotion: Alert and alert
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra shot awake at the sound."
msgstr "Самайра мгновенно проснулась от звука."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Samayra showed me. She guided me through the secret tunnels, I can find our way back. I left a magical trace."
msgstr "Самайра показала мне. Она провела меня по тайным туннелям, я смогу найти дорогу обратно. Я оставила магический след."

#. emotion: Exasperated relief
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra shrieked as Sarah spun her around, before finally putting her back down."
msgstr "Самайра взвизгнула, когда Сара закружила её, прежде чем наконец поставить обратно."

#. emotion: Casually amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra shrugged."
msgstr "Самайра пожала плечами."

#. emotion: Softly concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sighed."
msgstr "Самайра вздохнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra slightly pulled away her sleeping bag. Her dark skin was like bronze in the light of the fire."
msgstr "Самайра слегка отодвинула спальный мешок. Её тёмная кожа была как бронза в свете костра."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra slowly crossed the room, and the distance between them was gone."
msgstr "Самайра медленно пересекла комнату, и расстояние между ними исчезло."

#. emotion: Delicately, with reverence
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra slowly kneeled down."
msgstr "Самайра медленно опустилась на колени."

#. emotion: In a soft, gentle nod
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra slowly nodded."
msgstr "Самайра медленно кивнула."

#. emotion: Calmly awakening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra slowly recoverd from waking up so suddenly."
msgstr "Самайра медленно приходила в себя после такого внезапного пробуждения."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra slowly regained her composure. She firmly nodded, the way nobility could force themselves to."
msgstr "Самайра медленно пришла в себя. Она твёрдо кивнула, так, как умеют заставлять себя знать."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled again."
msgstr "Самайра снова улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled and nodded."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась и кивнула."

#. emotion: Playfully listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled as Sarah told her about her brother."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась, пока Сара рассказывала ей о брате."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled at Razaphel."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась Разафелю."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled at Sarah's concern for her."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась, тронутая заботой Сары."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled at Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась Саре."

#. emotion: Cautiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled at her compliment."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась её комплименту."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled at her."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась ей."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled at her. Her piercing eyes cutting into Sarah's."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась ей. Её пронзительные глаза встретились с глазами Сары."

#. emotion: Confusedly perplexed smile
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled awkwardly."
msgstr "Самайра неловко улыбнулась."

#. emotion: In a warm, affectionate tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled back at her."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась ей в ответ."

#. emotion: Casually content
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled softly, looking at the floor."
msgstr "Самайра мягко улыбнулась, глядя в пол."

#. emotion: Admiringly pleased
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled, happy that someone could see her in a place like this."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась, счастливая, что кто-то видит её в таком месте."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled, her fears at least somewhat put at ease."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась, её страхи хотя бы немного рассеялись."

#. emotion: Softly tender with a touch of sadness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled, though there was a pain in her face as well."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась, хотя на её лице была и боль."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiled."
msgstr "Самайра улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra smiles in the dark."
msgstr "Самайра улыбается в темноте."

#. emotion: Softly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra softly laughed."
msgstr "Самайра тихо рассмеялась."

#. emotion: In a serene, gentle manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra softly nodded."
msgstr "Самайра тихо кивнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra softly smiled as she began to pull on the strings that kept her clothes together."
msgstr "Самайра мягко улыбнулась, начиная тянуть завязки, державшие её одежду."

#. emotion: Tenderly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra softly smiled."
msgstr "Самайра мягко улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Softly pleading, with earnest imploration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sounded almost close to begging."
msgstr "Самайра говорила почти умоляюще."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sounded surprisingly strict."
msgstr "Самайра звучала на удивление строго."

#. emotion: In a fatigued sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra spoke between heavy breathing."
msgstr "Самайра говорила, тяжело дыша."

#. emotion: Cautiously excited
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra spoke while her mouth was still full of food."
msgstr "Самайра говорила с набитым ртом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra spread her arms wide as the spirit spun around her in a mist, slowly peeling away her clothes."
msgstr "Самайра широко раскинула руки, пока дух кружился вокруг неё туманом, медленно снимая с неё одежду."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra spread her legs, pressing her wet and hot sex against Sarah's upper leg."
msgstr "Самайра раздвинула ноги, прижимаясь своей влажной и горячей плотью к бедру Сары."

#. emotion: Suspiciously curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stepped into the room properly and frowned."
msgstr "Самайра вошла в комнату и нахмурилась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra still breathed heavily as she spoke, recovering."
msgstr "Самайра всё ещё тяжело дышала, когда заговорила, приходя в себя."

#. emotion: Intrigued, slightly concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra still leading, but Sarah could feel her instructions growing more sparse as they instead lost themselves in the dance."
msgstr "Самайра всё ещё вела, но Сара чувствовала, что её указания становятся всё реже, поскольку они растворились в танце."

#. emotion: Curiously observing, with slight bewilderment
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra still looked around, dazed, confused as to where she had woken up."
msgstr "Самайра всё ещё оглядывалась, ошеломлённая, не понимая, где проснулась."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stood on the other side of the desk."
msgstr "Самайра стояла по другую сторону стола."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stretched our her arms, her bones made a cracking sound as she did."
msgstr "Самайра потянулась, и её кости захрустели."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stuck her head around the corner, smiling."
msgstr "Самайра высунула голову из-за угла, улыбаясь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stuck out her tongue as she flung the bag across her back."
msgstr "Самайра высунула язык, перекидывая сумку через плечо."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stuck out her tongue at Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра показала Саре язык."

#. emotion: Nervously hesitant
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra stumbled over her own words as she tried to formulate a thought."
msgstr "Самайра запиналась, пытаясь сформулировать мысль."

#. emotion: Surprised gasp
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly jumped back, her face red."
msgstr "Самайра внезапно отпрыгнула, покраснев."

#. emotion: Surprised chuckle
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly laughed."
msgstr "Самайра вдруг рассмеялась."

#. emotion: With tender affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly leaned down. She softly pressed her lips up against Sarah's."
msgstr "Самайра внезапно наклонилась. Она мягко прижалась губами к губам Сары."

#. emotion: Eagerly delighted
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly leaned forward and quickly kissed Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра внезапно подалась вперёд и быстро поцеловала Сару."

#. emotion: Surprised, attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly looked back at her. Sarah could feel herself falling into Samayra's huge eyes."
msgstr "Самайра вдруг снова посмотрела на неё. Сара чувствовала, что тонет в огромных глазах Самайры."

#. emotion: In a contemplative manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly looked down at the ground. Her shoulders fell."
msgstr "Самайра внезапно опустила взгляд. Её плечи поникли."

#. emotion: Calmly, with intrigue
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly spun around, face red, as if caught doing something she wasn't supposed to."
msgstr "Самайра внезапно развернулась, покраснев, словно её застали за тем, чем не следовало."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly stopped."
msgstr "Самайра вдруг остановилась."

#. emotion: Calmly shocked
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra suddenly stopped. Her shoulders began to shake, a soft sob escaped her mouth."
msgstr "Самайра внезапно остановилась. Её плечи начали дрожать, изо рта вырвался тихий всхлип."

#. emotion: Relieved and compliant
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra sulked for a bit, only to nod and give in."
msgstr "Самайра немного надулась, но затем кивнула и сдалась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra threw a meaningful look at Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра многозначительно посмотрела на Сару."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra threw our her arms and did another spin, this time she slightly stumbled but quickly recovered."
msgstr "Самайра раскинула руки и сделала ещё один поворот, на этот раз слегка споткнулась, но быстро пришла в себя."

#. emotion: Admiringly observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra threw out her hands and did a surprisingly graceful pirouette."
msgstr "Самайра раскинула руки и сделала на удивление изящный пируэт."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra threw up her arms."
msgstr "Самайра всплеснула руками."

#. emotion: With a mix of defiance and resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra threw up her hands, as if to deflect their praise, and lowered her eyes as if to escape it."
msgstr "Самайра вскинула руки, словно отклоняя похвалу, и опустила глаза, будто пытаясь избежать её."

#. emotion: Casually amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra threw up three fingers."
msgstr "Самайра показала три пальца."

#. emotion: Tenderly embracing with a playful wink
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra took Sarah's hands and winked at her."
msgstr "Самайра взяла Сару за руки и подмигнула ей."

#. emotion: Excitedly, with enthusiasm
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra took off in a sprint."
msgstr "Самайра бросилась бегом."

#. emotion: With disgusted amazement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra took one sip, then she grimaced."
msgstr "Самайра сделала глоток и поморщилась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra took the stack of paperwork from Sarah's hands."
msgstr "Самайра взяла стопку бумаг из рук Сары."

#. emotion: Quietly bemused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned and left without saying much more."
msgstr "Самайра повернулась и ушла, не сказав больше ни слова."

#. emotion: In a detached, unemotional observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned and left."
msgstr "Самайра развернулась и ушла."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned around, smiling."
msgstr "Самайра обернулась, улыбаясь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned back to Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра обернулась к Саре."

#. emotion: Softly, with sadness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned her eyes to the ground."
msgstr "Самайра опустила глаза."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned to Sarah as they walked through the garden."
msgstr "Самайра повернулась к Саре, пока они шли по саду."

#. emotion: In a protective embrace, attentively caring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned to lead her back, but before she could, Sarah seized the princess by her wrist."
msgstr "Самайра повернулась, чтобы вести её обратно, но прежде чем она успела, Сара схватила принцессу за запястье."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned to look at her."
msgstr "Самайра повернулась, чтобы посмотреть на неё."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra turned, the whole of her body now facing Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра повернулась, теперь всем телом к Саре."

#. emotion: Contemplatively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra twiddled her thumbs and looked down at the sand."
msgstr "Самайра теребила большие пальцы, глядя в песок."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked back towards the passage at the other end of the room that had appeared."
msgstr "Самайра пошла обратно к проходу на другом конце комнаты, который появился."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked forward."
msgstr "Самайра шагнула вперёд."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked further into the room, leaning across the desk."
msgstr "Самайра прошла дальше в комнату, опершись на стол."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked into the room, her footsteps light and soundless."
msgstr "Самайра вошла в комнату, её шаги были лёгкими и бесшумными."

#. emotion: Tenderly, with care
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked over and grabbed her hand."
msgstr "Самайра подошла и взяла её за руку."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked up closer to Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра подошла ближе к Саре."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked up to her as she looked out over the sea of people."
msgstr "Самайра подошла к ней, пока она смотрела на море людей."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra walked up towards the desk and planted her palms on the surface, leaning forward."
msgstr "Самайра подошла к столу и упёрлась ладонями в поверхность, подавшись вперёд."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was a hard person not to look at."
msgstr "На Самайру было трудно не смотреть."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was close behind her. The girl seemed desperate not to get seperated from Sarah."
msgstr "Самайра была прямо за ней. Девушка, казалось, отчаянно не хотела отрываться от Сары."

#. emotion: Intrigued curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was defiant, looking directly at Hecate."
msgstr "Самайра с вызовом посмотрела прямо на Гекату."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was doing magic, however simplistic...she was doing it."
msgstr "Самайра творила магию, какой бы простой она ни была... она творила её."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was hesitant for a moment, but gave in and came closer."
msgstr "Самайра колебалась мгновение, но сдалась и подошла ближе."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was hesitant for a moment, but gave in and walked up to the bed."
msgstr "Самайра колебалась мгновение, но сдалась и подошла к кровати."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was not far behind."
msgstr "Самайра была недалеко позади."

#. emotion: In a worried, protective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was pinned up against one of the bookcases, nearly digging into it."
msgstr "Самайра была прижата к одному из книжных шкафов, почти вдавлена в него."

#. emotion: In a flat, detached observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was proving herself useful as her secretary, a hundred times over, but they were heading into war."
msgstr "Самайра проявляла себя как полезный секретарь, сторицей, но они направлялись на войну."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was quick to add."
msgstr "Быстро добавила Самайра."

#. emotion: Silently intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was quiet."
msgstr "Самайра молчала."

#. emotion: Calmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was right."
msgstr "Самайра была права."

#. emotion: In a somber, resigned tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was running out of time."
msgstr "У Самайры оставалось мало времени."

#. emotion: Calm and reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was safe."
msgstr "Самайра была в безопасности."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was sitting in one of the chairs. They were so large, the small girl almost seemed to dissapear into them."
msgstr "Самайра сидела в одном из кресел. Они были такими большими, что маленькая девочка почти исчезала в них."

#. emotion: Admiringly delighted
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was smiling more than Sarah had seen since she left Bagrad."
msgstr "Самайра улыбалась больше, чем Сара видела с тех пор, как они покинули Баград."

#. emotion: Contentedly, as if deeply satisfied
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was sound asleep, despite everything."
msgstr "Самайра крепко спала, несмотря ни на что."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was sprawled across a desk full of paperwork."
msgstr "Самайра развалилась на столе, заваленном бумагами."

#. emotion: Softly, with tenderness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was still asleep next to her."
msgstr "Самайра всё ещё спала рядом с ней."

#. emotion: Gentle concern
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was still fast asleep in her bed."
msgstr "Самайра всё ещё крепко спала в своей кровати."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was turning red from the praise."
msgstr "Самайра покраснела от похвалы."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra was walking a little ways ahead as well."
msgstr "Самайра тоже шла немного впереди."

#. emotion: In a detached curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra waved her hand."
msgstr "Самайра махнула рукой."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra went quiet for a brief moment."
msgstr "Самайра замолчала на мгновение."

#. emotion: Annoyed disbelief
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Samayra!"
msgstr "Самайра!"

#. emotion: In a frustrated, angry tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Samayra! No! Go away!"
msgstr "Самайра! Нет! Уходи!"

#. emotion: Excitedly shouting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Samayra! This is amazing!"
msgstr "Самайра! Это потрясающе!"

#. emotion: In a concerned, frantic tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Samayra! Where are you!"
msgstr "Самайра! Где ты!"

#. emotion: Excitedly shouting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Samayra!!!"
msgstr "Самайра!!!"

#. emotion: Euphoric joyfully
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra's animated voice seemed to lighten up the room."
msgstr "Оживлённый голос Самайры, казалось, осветил комнату."

#. emotion: Firmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra's answer was resolute. Not even a hint of doubt."
msgstr "Ответ Самайры был твёрдым. Ни намёка на сомнение."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra's body yielded nearly as quickly as her clothes did as Sarah pulled them off her."
msgstr "Тело Самайры уступило почти так же быстро, как и одежда, когда Сара сняла её."

#. emotion: Quietly hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra's confession was nearly lost to her among the loud moans, but Sarah had heard it."
msgstr "Признание Самайры почти потонуло в громких стонах, но Сара услышала его."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra's entire body language grew increasingly excited with each word."
msgstr "Язык тела Самайры становился всё более возбуждённым с каждым словом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Samayra's eyes drifted away, seemingly lost in a fantasy."
msgstr "Взгляд Самайры устремился вдаль, словно она потерялась в фантазиях."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
