msgid "Sarah caught his eyes wandering past her, towards Dio near the fire."
msgstr "Сара заметила, как его взгляд скользнул мимо неё к Дио у костра."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah caught what she could with her mouth, but she was covered in it. Drenched in it."
msgstr "Сара ловила ртом, что могла, но была вся покрыта этим. Пропитана этим."

#. emotion: Warily with restrained fury
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah channeled years of pent up rage."
msgstr "Сара вложила годы сдерживаемой ярости."

#. emotion: Meticulously attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah checked her body for injuries but found none."
msgstr "Сара осмотрела себя на предмет ран, но не нашла ни одной."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah chopped up some of the vegetables, adding them into the pot."
msgstr "Сара нарезала немного овощей и добавила их в котёл."

#. emotion: Warily curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah chose to break it."
msgstr "Сара решила нарушить её."

#. emotion: Playfully amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah chuckled to herself."
msgstr "Сара тихо рассмеялась."

#. emotion: Playfully teasing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah chuckled."
msgstr "Сара усмехнулась."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clapsed her own hands, keeping them still."
msgstr "Сара сцепила руки, стараясь удержать их неподвижно."

#. emotion: Tenderly embracing, with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clasped her hands around Samayra's face, forcing her to look into her eyes."
msgstr "Сара обхватила лицо Самайры руками, заставляя её посмотреть в глаза."

#. emotion: Determinedly clinging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clasped the bars with all her strength, trying to hold on as best she could."
msgstr "Сара вцепилась в прутья изо всех сил, стараясь держаться как можно лучше."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleaned her blade and placed it back in its sheath."
msgstr "Сара очистила клинок и убрала его в ножны."

#. emotion: Calmly enlightened
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleared her mind, sharpened her focus."
msgstr "Сара прояснила разум, обострила внимание."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleared her throat to announce herself again."
msgstr "Сара прочистила горло, снова объявляя о себе."

#. emotion: Nervously anticipating recognition
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleared her throat, making the two most important men in her life aware of her arrival."
msgstr "Сара прочистила горло, давая двум самым важным мужчинам в её жизни знать о её прибытии."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleared her throat, trying to get the orc's attention."
msgstr "Сара прочистила горло, пытаясь привлечь внимание орка."

#. emotion: Reflectively amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleared her throat."
msgstr "Сара прочистила горло."

#. emotion: Reflectively nostalgic
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cleared the tears from her eyes."
msgstr "Сара вытерла слёзы с глаз."

#. emotion: Cautiously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clenched her end tighter."
msgstr "Сара сжала свой край крепче."

#. emotion: Tense anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clenched her fists again."
msgstr "Сара снова сжала кулаки."

#. emotion: Somberly tense
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clenched her fists."
msgstr "Сара сжала кулаки."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climaxes, her eyes rolling back in her head, her body writhing around as the pleasure rolls over her."
msgstr "Сара достигает пика, глаза закатываются, тело извивается, когда волна наслаждения накрывает её."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climbed atop one of the large stone blocks and looked out across the room."
msgstr "Сара забралась на один из больших каменных блоков и оглядела зал."

#. emotion: Calmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climbed onto the bed, towering over Samayra, sprawled on her back."
msgstr "Сара забралась на кровать, возвышаясь над Самайрой, раскинувшейся на спине."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climbed onto the box of the cart and began to get dressed as best she could."
msgstr "Сара забралась на сиденье повозки и начала одеваться как могла."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climbed onto the first small rowboat and allowed herself to be ferried to land."
msgstr "Сара забралась в первую маленькую шлюпку и позволила доставить себя на берег."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climbed to the top of another block of stone."
msgstr "Сара забралась на вершину ещё одного каменного блока."

#. emotion: Alertly curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah climbed up the barricade and peered over the edge."
msgstr "Сара забралась на баррикаду и выглянула через край."

#. emotion: In a gentle, hopeful tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes again, hoping to fall back to sleep."
msgstr "Сара снова закрыла глаза, надеясь снова заснуть."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and called forth the spirit, as she had only a day before."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и призвала духа, как делала всего день назад."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and emptied her mind."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и опустошила сознание."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and focussed."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и сосредоточилась."

#. emotion: Calmly content, with serene satisfaction
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and laid still until sleep overtook her."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и лежала неподвижно, пока сон не одолел её."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and leaned forward, parting her lips."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и подалась вперёд, разомкнув губы."

#. emotion: With warm, affectionate enthusiasm
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and made that same bargain that all lovers make."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и заключила ту же сделку, что заключают все влюблённые."

#. emotion: Calmly, with determination
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and prayed that she was doing the right thing."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и молилась, что поступает правильно."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and repeated the steps as she had many times now."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и повторила шаги, как делала уже много раз."

#. emotion: Faintly, with fatigue
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and repeated the words over and over again in her mind, until she faded from consciousness."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и повторяла эти слова снова и снова в мыслях, пока не потеряла сознание."

#. emotion: In a reflective, soft tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and repeated what she had been taught."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и повторила то, чему её учили."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and steeled herself to be calm."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и заставила себя успокоиться."

#. emotion: In a serene, contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and took in the quiet of the room. The serenity that could only come from being alone."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и впитала тишину комнаты. Безмятежность, которая могла только прийти от пребывания одна."

#. emotion: Tentatively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and tried to do as he said."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и попыталась сделать, как он сказал."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and visualized the city. The vast desert around it. The edge of the world."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и представила город. Огромную пустыню вокруг него. Край света."

#. emotion: In a soft, contented sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes and was happy. Happy that they wouldn't force her to do more."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и была счастлива. Счастлива, что они не заставили её сделать больше."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes as the intensity of Kate's kiss grew. First only her lips, then her tongue."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза, когда поцелуй Кейт стал страстным: сначала только губы, затем язык."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes for a moment. Life didn't seem all that bad here."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза на мгновение. Жизнь здесь не казалась такой уж плохой."

#. emotion: Reflectively intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes, and wondered if he could be right."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и задумалась, может ли он быть прав."

#. emotion: Softly, tenderly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her eyes."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза."

#. emotion: Cautiously amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed her fist around the bow and arrow. It felt like a joke compared to what she was seeing."
msgstr "Сара сжала в кулаке лук и стрелу. Это казалось насмешкой по сравнению с тем, что она видела."

#. emotion: Nervously hesitant
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed here eyes and steeled herself."
msgstr "Сара закрыла глаза и собралась с духом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed the distance, standing still next to the both of them."
msgstr "Сара сократила расстояние, остановившись рядом с ними обоими."

#. emotion: In a soft, resigned sigh
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closed the door to her room behind her."
msgstr "Сара закрыла дверь своей комнаты за собой."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closely observed Maeiv."
msgstr "Сара внимательно наблюдала за Маэйв."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah closely studied Dalia. Outside of the Master, she was the only person here."
msgstr "Сара внимательно изучала Далию. Кроме Хозяина, она была единственным человеком здесь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clumsily began to strip out of the underwear."
msgstr "Сара неловко начала стягивать с себя бельё."

#. emotion: Cautiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clung on to the little bit of certainty that she now had in her life."
msgstr "Сара цеплялась за ту маленькую определённость, которая теперь была в её жизни."

#. emotion: Anxiously gripping
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clung to the wall for balance as her master ravaged her from behind."
msgstr "Сара цеплялась за стену, чтобы удержать равновесие, пока хозяин овладевал ею сзади."

#. emotion: Suspiciously anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah clutched her sword as she saw the Tribesmen advance, now so close she could make them out."
msgstr "Сара сжала меч, глядя, как Племенники приближаются — теперь так близко, что она могла их разглядеть."

#. emotion: In a somber, reflective tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed against the floor."
msgstr "Сара рухнула на пол."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed back into the bed, exhausted and thoroughly pleasured."
msgstr "Сара рухнула на кровать, изнурённая и полностью удовлетворённая."

#. emotion: Surprised yet tender
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed forward into the bed."
msgstr "Сара рухнула лицом в кровать."

#. emotion: With an air of somber seriousness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed forward onto the table."
msgstr "Сара рухнула вперёд на стол."

#. emotion: In a detached, observing manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed forward."
msgstr "Сара упала вперёд."

#. emotion: In a sorrowful, helpless whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed further, sprawled out across the deck, she didn't have the energy to speak."
msgstr "Сара рухнула, распластавшись по палубе, у неё не было сил говорить."

#. emotion: Wearily resigned
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed into her bed, staring at the ceiling."
msgstr "Сара рухнула на кровать, уставившись в потолок."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed on top of the orc, her hands exploring his chest, looking for a place to rest."
msgstr "Сара рухнула на орка, руки искали место отдохновения на его груди."

#. emotion: In a tearful sobbing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapsed to her knees, no longer able to look at the battlefield."
msgstr "Сара упала на колени, не в силах больше смотреть на поле боя."

#. emotion: With a mix of concern and tenderness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapses into the bed, sweat dripping off her body."
msgstr "Сара падает на кровать, пот стекает по её телу."

#. emotion: Calmly observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collapses onto one of the benches. Off into the distance, she can see the first rays of sunlight creeping over the horizon."
msgstr "Сара падает на одну из скамеек. Вдалеке она видит первые лучи солнца, ползущие над горизонтом."

#. emotion: In a detached, clinical tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collected her clothes and got dressed again."
msgstr "Сара собрала одежду и снова оделась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collected her clothes from the floor, careful to wrap them under her arms without getting cum on them."
msgstr "Сара собрала одежду с пола, стараясь завернуть её под мышкой так, чтобы не испачкать спермой."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah collected the bucket and mop, adding a splash of soap, she began to scrub the upper deck of the ship."
msgstr "Сара взяла ведро и швабру, добавила немного мыла и начала драить верхнюю палубу корабля."

#. emotion: Reflectively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah committed  the painting to mind. Then, she reached out, and with the touch of her palm, burned it."
msgstr "Сара запечатлела картину в памяти. Затем она протянула руку и прикосновением ладони сожгла её."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah committed  the painting to mind. Then, she swung her sword across it, slashing the frame in half."
msgstr "Сара запечатлела картину в памяти. Затем она взмахнула мечом, разрубив раму пополам."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah committed herself."
msgstr "Сара решилась."

#. emotion: In a detached, almost dismissive tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah complained by making inarticulate noises."
msgstr "Сара пожаловалась нечленораздельными звуками."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah complained."
msgstr "Пожаловалась Сара."

#. emotion: With cautious optimism
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah concluded it was probably better to do it herself."
msgstr "Сара решила, что, вероятно, лучше сделать это самой."

#. emotion: Confidently, assuredly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah concluded that he was probably right about that."
msgstr "Сара решила, что он, вероятно, прав."

#. emotion: Calmly dismissive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah concluded that it was likely nothing and went back to bed."
msgstr "Сара решила, что это, скорее всего, пустяк, и вернулась в постель."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah confessed her answer."
msgstr "Сара призналась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah confessed the truth that was in her heart."
msgstr "Сара признала правду, что была у неё на сердце."

#. emotion: Reflectively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered Marion's words for a moment."
msgstr "Сара на мгновение задумалась над словами Мариона."

#. emotion: Contemplatively attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered all that Lady Carolyn had told her."
msgstr "Сара обдумала всё, что сказала леди Кэролин."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered apologizing to her friend next time she saw her."
msgstr "Сара подумала извиниться перед подругой при следующей встрече."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered asking Kate to fight in her place, but she could see the pain in Kate's eyes."
msgstr "Сара подумывала попросить Кейт сразиться вместо себя, но видела боль в её глазах."

#. emotion: Contemplatively puzzled
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered for a moment what her best answer would be."
msgstr "Сара на мгновение задумалась, какой ответ будет наилучшим."

#. emotion: Thoughtfully contemplating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered for a moment."
msgstr "Сара задумалась на мгновение."

#. emotion: Reflectively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered for a while."
msgstr "Сара задумалась на мгновение."

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered her answer."
msgstr "Сара обдумала ответ."

#. emotion: Reflectively considering
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered her options."
msgstr "Сара обдумывала варианты."

#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered her question for a while."
msgstr "Сара обдумывала свой вопрос некоторое время."

#. emotion: Deliberately thoughtful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered her question."
msgstr "Сара обдумала свой вопрос."

#. emotion: Attentively considering
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered her words carefully."
msgstr "Сара тщательно обдумала слова."

#. emotion: Thoughtful anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered her words for a while, before deciding to speak."
msgstr "Сара некоторое время обдумывала слова, прежде чем решиться заговорить."

#. emotion: Thoughtfully contemplating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered his words, then nodded."
msgstr "Сара обдумала его слова, затем кивнула."

#. emotion: Attentively pondering
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered it, but then thought it would be better to stay at the camp."
msgstr "Сара подумала и решила, что лучше остаться в лагере."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered it."
msgstr "Сара задумалась."

#. emotion: Pensively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered it. Perhaps, but she had little way of knowing what was in Marion's heart. She had always considered him loyal. How foolish, she now realized."
msgstr "Сара задумалась. Возможно, но у неё не было способа узнать, что у Мариона на сердце. Она всегда считала его верным. Как глупо, осознала она теперь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered the man for a moment longer."
msgstr "Сара ещё мгновение размышляла об этом человеке."

#. emotion: Thoughtfully considered
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered the proposal."
msgstr "Сара обдумала предложение."

#. emotion: Calm contemplation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered the words."
msgstr "Сара обдумала эти слова."

#. emotion: Reflective, with curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered, but knew the question that still lingered."
msgstr "Сара задумалась, но знала, какой вопрос всё ещё оставался."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considered. She had to admit she never had. She shook her head."
msgstr "Сара задумалась. Пришлось признать, что нет. Она покачала головой."

#. emotion: Thoughtfully reflective
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah considers the proposal."
msgstr "Сара обдумывает предложение."

#. emotion: Contemplative, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah contemplated her position."
msgstr "Сара обдумывала своё положение."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued cleaning the walls of the castle."
msgstr "Сара продолжила чистить стены замка."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued following along the street as it merged with the main street."
msgstr "Сара продолжала идти по улице, пока та не слилась с главной."

#. emotion: Determinedly, with resolve
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued her advance, swinging her blade with the same practiced pace."
msgstr "Сара продолжала наступление, взмахивая клинком в том же отработанном темпе."

#. emotion: Neutrally attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued her work."
msgstr "Сара продолжила свою работу."

#. emotion: Quietly introspective
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued looking at her claw, still stunned at her own work."
msgstr "Сара продолжала смотреть на свой коготь, всё ещё ошеломлённая собственной работой."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued moving her body against his."
msgstr "Сара продолжала двигать телом, прижимаясь к нему."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued moving her head to his instructions."
msgstr "Сара продолжала двигать головой по его командам."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued observing the crowd from a small distance."
