msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, пока Мариус объяснял устройство Галлоуз-Крик."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listend intently."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала."

#. emotion: Quietly attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listend quietly."
msgstr "Сара тихо слушала."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listend to her friend."
msgstr "Сара слушала своего друга."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened and followed as the orc instructed her."
msgstr "Сара слушала и выполняла указания орка."

#. emotion: Attentively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened as Lily began to rant."
msgstr "Сара слушала, как Лили начала возмущаться."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened as Varga entrusted his worries to her."
msgstr "Сара слушала, как Варга доверяет ей свои тревоги."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened as Xan painted a bleak picture."
msgstr "Сара слушала, как Ксан рисовал мрачную картину."

#. emotion: Tenderly intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened as Xan painted a picture of her life."
msgstr "Сара слушала, как Ксан рисует картину её жизни."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened as he explained, as if all of this was obvious, rather than madness."
msgstr "Сара слушала его объяснения — он говорил так, будто всё это было очевидно, а не безумие."

#. emotion: Calmly attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened as he handed down the instructions to her."
msgstr "Сара слушала, как он давал ей указания."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened closely."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened deep into the end of the day as Metis went through all the instructions."
msgstr "Сара слушала до самого конца дня, пока Метис излагал все инструкции."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened eagerly as Edmond switched from topic-to-topic."
msgstr "Сара с интересом слушала, как Эдмонд переключался с темы на тему."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as Lady Carolyn explained."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала объяснения леди Кэролайн."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as Lady Carolyn went over all the documentation in great detail."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, как леди Кэролайн очень подробно разбирала всю документацию."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as Xan spoke."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, пока Ксан говорил."

#. emotion: Attentively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as he explained the workings of astral navigation."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, пока он объяснял принципы астральной навигации."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as her husband went over the strategy."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, как муж объяснял стратегию."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as her warmaster went over the strategy."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, пока её военачальник излагал стратегию."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently as the spirit continued to speak."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, пока дух продолжал говорить."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently to Kate."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently to Marion. It wasn't often that he shared insights into his inner world."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала Мариона. Он нечасто открывал свой внутренний мир."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently to Xan, then dared to ask him."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала Ксана, а затем осмелилась спросить."

#. emotion: Attentively, with curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently, trying to take all of this in."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала, пытаясь осознать всё это."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened intently. There was some truth to what he was saying. Even a victory here could be a painful one."
msgstr "Сара внимательно слушала. В его словах была правда. Даже победа здесь может быть болезненной."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to her brother share his troubles. She knew how hard everything weighed on Thomas."
msgstr "Сара слушала, как брат делится своими бедами. Она знала, как тяжело всё это давит на Томаса."

#. emotion: Delightedly sharing, with a hint of pride
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to her brother speak. It was clear that he was being honest."
msgstr "Сара слушала брата. Было ясно, что он говорит искренне."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to her own breathing. The rising and falling of her own chest with each breath drawn."
msgstr "Сара слушала собственное дыхание. Подъём и падение собственной груди с каждым вдохом."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to him explain."
msgstr "Сара слушала его объяснения."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to the man intently."
msgstr "Сара слушала мужчину внимательно."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to the man speak."
msgstr "Сара слушала, что говорил мужчина."

#. emotion: Attentively, with curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened to what Xan told her."
msgstr "Сара выслушала то, что сказал ей Ксан."

#. emotion: Ironic amusement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened with utter disbelief at Sophia's story."
msgstr "Сара слушала историю Софии с полным недоверием."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened, but Samayra didn't seem very convinced of the words she was saying."
msgstr "Сара слушала, но Самайра, похоже, не очень верила собственным словам."

#. emotion: Delicately intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listened. Whenever Samayra had a topic she liked to talk about, her voice would gradually shift towards one of excitement, rather than her natural nervousness."
msgstr "Сара слушала. Когда у Самайры была тема, о которой ей нравилось говорить, её голос постепенно становился взволнованным, вместо привычной нервозности."

#. emotion: Nervously attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah listens to Mary's moaning, deep and restrained, intense."
msgstr "Сара слышит стоны Мэри — глубокие, сдержанные, страстные."

#. emotion: Cautiously admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah lived for Atilla's compliments."
msgstr "Сара жила ради похвалы Атиллы."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah locked eyes with Lily."
msgstr "Сара встретилась взглядом с Лили."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah look off to the side of the alley and waves for attention."
msgstr "Сара смотрит в сторону переулка и машет, привлекая внимание."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked Jaeid until he met her eyes."
msgstr "Сара смотрела на Джаида, пока он не встретил её взгляд."

#. emotion: Attentively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked Vaelen from across the room. She considered asking Lady Carolyn about her view on him."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Ваэлена через комнату. Она подумывала спросить леди Кэролайн о её мнении о нём."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked Xan in the eyes, she shook her head."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела Ксану в глаза и покачала головой."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about and knew that it was true. The Inn always seemed full of people."
msgstr "Сара огляделась и поняла, что это правда. Гостиница всегда казалась полной людей."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about as she took in the city of Rahayal for the last time."
msgstr "Сара оглядывалась, впитывая город Рахаял в последний раз."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about the camp."
msgstr "Сара оглядела лагерь."

#. emotion: Casually indifferent
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about the dark and grey tunnels. A bleak place like this felt as fitting as any other."
msgstr "Сара оглядела тёмные и серые туннели. Такое мрачное место казалось подходящим как никакое другое."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about the room as she considered."
msgstr "Сара оглядела комнату, размышляя."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about the room."
msgstr "Сара оглядела комнату."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about the tent and saw a familiar shape."
msgstr "Сара оглядела шатёр и увидела знакомый силуэт."

#. emotion: Hesitantly curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about, almost too afraid to directly ask."
msgstr "Сара оглянулась, почти боясь спросить прямо."

#. emotion: Intrigued yet slightly awestruck
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about, the writhing masses of creatures, pulsed like a single entity."
msgstr "Сара огляделась — извивающиеся массы существ пульсировали как единое целое."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked about."
msgstr "Сара огляделась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across her army as the casualties mounted."
msgstr "Сара оглядела свою армию по мере роста потерь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the campfire, and saw the officer was distracted, discussing something with another soldier."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела через костёр и увидела, что офицер отвлёкся, обсуждая что-то с другим солдатом."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the edge of the water."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на другой берег."

#. emotion: In a flat, detached manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the hall."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела через зал."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the hallway."
msgstr "Сара оглядела коридор."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the room and saw the sea of faces."
msgstr "Сара оглядела комнату и увидела море лиц."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the room, anxious faces."
msgstr "Сара оглядела комнату — повсюду были встревоженные лица."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the square, everywhere her men were already setting up their camps."
msgstr "Сара оглядела площадь — повсюду её люди уже разбивали лагерь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked across the surface of the pool."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на поверхность бассейна."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked ahead."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела вперёд."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around again."
msgstr "Сара снова огляделась."

#. emotion: Casually acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around and nodded."
msgstr "Сара огляделась и кивнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around and realized she was sitting on cold stone."
msgstr "Сара огляделась и поняла, что сидит на холодном камне."

#. emotion: Reflectively thoughtful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around and saw that it was a good deal less charming on the inside than it had been from the outside."
msgstr "Сара огляделась и поняла, что внутри дом был гораздо менее очаровательным, чем снаружи."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around as she slowly saw the buildings turn for the worse."
msgstr "Сара оглядывалась, медленно наблюдая, как здания становятся всё хуже."

#. emotion: Coldly detached
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around at the carnage."
msgstr "Сара огляделась на кровавую бойню."

#. emotion: In a concerned, searching manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around but she could not find him again."
msgstr "Сара огляделась, но снова не смогла найти его."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around franctically trying to find it."
msgstr "Сара лихорадочно оглядывалась, пытаясь найти его."

#. emotion: Anxiously searching
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around frantically for any sight of the creature, but found only the house."
msgstr "Сара лихорадочно огляделась в поисках существа, но увидела только дом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around her."
msgstr "Сара огляделась."

#. emotion: In a horrified, wide-eyed gasp
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the campfire, and saw that all the men had their eyes on every part of her. She did her best to cover herself, but the men never looked away."
msgstr "Сара огляделась вокруг костра и увидела, что все мужчины пожирают глазами каждую часть её тела. Она изо всех сил пыталась прикрыться, но мужчины не отводили взгляда."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the clearing. Near the edges, plants of all kinds grew so thick they blocked any view in or out."
msgstr "Сара оглядела поляну. У краёв растения всех видов росли так густо, что полностью скрывали вид как внутрь, так и наружу."

#. emotion: In a reflective trance
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the dark tunnels. She wondered how many layers of stone were build on top of them. A frightening thought."
msgstr "Сара оглядела тёмные туннели. Она гадала, сколько слоёв камня было построено над ними. Пугающая мысль."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the edge of the water. More than a few women were running around, playing."
msgstr "Сара оглядела берег. Немало женщин бегали и играли."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the edges of the water."
msgstr "Сара оглядела берега озера."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the oasis."
msgstr "Сара оглядела оазис."

#. emotion: Neutrally admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the palace."
msgstr "Сара оглядела дворец."

#. emotion: In awe, with wide-eyed wonder
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the room and saw more than two dozen people, wandering about the room."
msgstr "Сара оглядела комнату и увидела больше двух дюжин человек, снующих по ней."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the room."
msgstr "Сара оглядела комнату."

#. emotion: Attentively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around to where they were."
msgstr "Сара осмотрелась вокруг."

#. emotion: In awe, marveling
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around, all she could see was the carnage that passed for a feast."
msgstr "Сара огляделась, всё, что она могла видеть, — это бойня, которая сходила за пир."

#. emotion: In a detached, curious manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around, but other than her, nobody seemed to have noticed anything strange."
msgstr "Сара огляделась, но, кроме неё, никто, казалось, не заметил ничего странного."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around, making sure they were alone."
msgstr "Сара огляделась, убеждаясь, что они одни."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around, the large open space was now behind her. Here, her speed was an advantage."
msgstr "Сара огляделась — большое открытое пространство теперь было позади неё. Здесь её скорость была преимуществом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around, trying to find an answer."
msgstr "Сара огляделась, пытаясь найти ответ."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around, wondering where if anything this might have come from."
msgstr "Сара огляделась, гадая, откуда это могло взяться."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around."
msgstr "Сара огляделась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around. Bargaining with the orc had been one thing, but now, she found herself having to deliver...she hesitated."
msgstr "Сара огляделась. Торговаться с орком было одним, но теперь нужно было выполнять... она колебалась."

#. emotion: Warily curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around. The room was almost disorienting in its uniformity. Endless grey stone."
msgstr "Сара огляделась. Комната была почти дезориентирующей в своём однообразии. Бесконечный серый камень."

#. emotion: Cautiously curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around. There were booths set up all around the area."
msgstr "Сара огляделась. Вокруг стояли кабинки."

#. emotion: Contemplative, with a hint of relief
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around. With her work done, there wasn't much of a reason to stay here anymore."
msgstr "Сара огляделась. С работой покончено, оставаться здесь больше не было смысла."

#. emotion: Anxiously apprehensive stare
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Alaric's stern face, worried."
msgstr "Сара встревоженно посмотрела на суровое лицо Аларика."

#. emotion: Puzzledly looking at Alaric
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Alaric, confused."
msgstr "Сара растерянно посмотрела на Аларика."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Alaric."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Аларика."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Belmont. Was he jealous?"
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Белмонта. Он ревновал?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Carolyn."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Кэролайн."

#. emotion: Sternly evaluating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Cassius, then Dio, back and forth."
msgstr "Сара переводила взгляд с Кассия на Дио и обратно."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Dalia and saw she carried the same mark as her."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Далию и увидела, что у та такая же метка."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Dalia, just as Dalia threw more water onto her."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Далию как раз в тот момент, когда та плеснула на неё ещё воды."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Dalia, who simply nodded."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Далию, которая просто кивнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Dio."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Дио."

#. emotion: Thoughtfully pondering
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Edmond and considered."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Эдмонда и задумалась."

#. emotion: Nervously curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Eula and could feel her heart begin to beat faster."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Юлу и почувствовала, как её сердце начало биться быстрее."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Eula."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Юлу."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Gabriel as he continued to steadily march alongside her."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Габриэля, который продолжал ровно шагать рядом с ней."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Gabriel, thrusting, taking control of Hecate."
msgstr "Сара смотрела на Габриэля, входящего в Гекату, берущего над ней контроль."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Gideon."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Гидеона."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Hecate."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Гекату."

#. emotion: Panic-stricken, accusatory stare
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Jaeid with a panicked expression, but only saw him laughing."
msgstr "Сара взглянула на Джаида с паническим выражением лица, но увидела лишь, что он смеётся."

#. emotion: Intrigued curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked at Jaeid."
msgstr "Сара посмотрела на Джаида."

