msgstr "Саре нужно было лишь закрыть глаза, и она клялась, что слышит его мысли."

#. emotion: Anxiously gripping
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nervously gripped the edge of the cart's seat."
msgstr "Сара нервно вцепилась в край сиденья повозки."

#. emotion: Anxiously scanning the room
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nervously looked about."
msgstr "Сара нервно огляделась."

#. emotion: Anxiously tapping foot
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nervously tapped her feet."
msgstr "Сара нервно постукивала ногой."

#. emotion: Anxiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nervously watched the two men."
msgstr "Сара нервно наблюдала за двумя мужчинами."

#. emotion: Softly, tenderly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nestled herself into his arms."
msgstr "Сара устроилась в его объятиях."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never asked Dalia to join her in the bed."
msgstr "Сара так и не попросила Далию пригласить её в кровать."

#. emotion: In a tone of disgusted disgust
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never broke her motion, continuing to thrust up and down and load after load of semen sprayed onto her face, onto her chest."
msgstr "Сара не прекращала движения, продолжая двигаться вверх-вниз, и порция за порцией спермы попадала ей на лицо, на грудь."

#. emotion: In a detached, detached surprise
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never felt herself hitting the ground."
msgstr "Сара даже не почувствовала, как ударилась о землю."

#. emotion: Somberly regretful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never had much patience for such things, even when she had still been young. She had even less now."
msgstr "У Сары никогда не было большого терпения к таким вещам, даже когда она была молода. Теперь его стало ещё меньше."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never knew how to act around her, and so instead, she fumbled."
msgstr "Сара никогда не знала, как вести себя с ней, и поэтому вместо этого мялась."

#. emotion: Somberly contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never saw the blade that ended her life; the world only went dark."
msgstr "Сара никогда не увидела лезвия, оборвавшего её жизнь; мир просто померк."

#. emotion: Excitedly, with a burst of energy
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never stops to turn around, in a mad dash, she's out of the alley and onto the street."
msgstr "Сара даже не останавливается, чтобы обернуться; в бешеном рывке она вылетает из переулка на улицу."

#. emotion: In a resigned, contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never wanted the crown for herself, but she accepted the role of regent, to rule in his stead until the day he would be better, though both feared such a day would never come."
msgstr "Сара никогда не хотела короны для себя, но приняла роль регента, чтобы править вместо него до того дня, когда ему станет лучше, хотя оба боялись, что этот день никогда не настанет."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah never wanted to leave this moment."
msgstr "Сара никогда не хотела покидать этот момент."

#. emotion: Empathetically encouraging tears
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah no longer only cried with her voice, but could now also feel the tears streaming down her face."
msgstr "Сара уже не просто кричала — она чувствовала, как слёзы текут по её лицу."

#. emotion: Tenderly concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah no longer turned around to look, but outside, Kate crawled up to her feet as best she could, and stumbled away, tears still streaming."
msgstr "Сара больше не оборачивалась, но снаружи Кейт кое-как поднялась на ноги и, спотыкаясь, побрела прочь, слёзы всё ещё текли по её лицу."

#. emotion: Casually acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded absently."
msgstr "Сара рассеянно кивнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded again."
msgstr "Сара снова кивнула."

#. emotion: Warily attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as Lady Carolyn spoke."
msgstr "Сара кивала, пока леди Кэролин говорила."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as Sigmund continued to explain."
msgstr "Сара кивала, пока Сигмунд продолжал объяснять."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as he continued to explain."
msgstr "Сара кивала, пока он продолжал объяснять."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as he explained it to her."
msgstr "Сара кивала, пока он объяснял."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as he spoke."
msgstr "Сара кивала, пока он говорил."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along as she listened."
msgstr "Сара кивала, слушая."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along."
msgstr "Сара кивнула."

#. emotion: Slightly perplexed but hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded along. She didn't know how to do any of that, but she was eager to learn or at least try."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она не умела ничего из этого, но горела желанием научиться или хотя бы попробовать."

#. emotion: Contentedly smiling, with warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and began to serve the men their dinner."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и начала подавать мужчинам ужин."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and began to walk away as quickly as she could."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и пошла прочь так быстро, как могла."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and began to walk back in the direction of the officer cabin."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и направилась обратно в сторону каюты офицера."

#. emotion: Welcomingly with respect
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and bowed."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и поклонилась."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and excitedly retrieved the food."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и с воодушевлением принесла еду."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and followed Sigmund's instructions, climbing onto the front of the cart."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и, следуя указаниям Сигмунда, забралась на передок повозки."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and intently listened to his every word. With each new lecture, new worlds began to open to her."
msgstr "Сара кивала и внимательно слушала каждое его слово. С каждой новой лекцией перед ней открывались новые миры."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and kept her eyes fixed on him."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и не сводила с него глаз."

#. emotion: Calmly content
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and left for her room."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и ушла в свою комнату."

#. emotion: Casually pleased
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and left."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и ушла."

#. emotion: Confidently, with assurance
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and motioned for the man to continue."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и жестом велела мужчине продолжать."

#. emotion: Nodding with warmth and affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and placed her hand on his arm."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и положила руку ему на плечо."

#. emotion: Calmly confident
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and resumed her kitchen work."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и вернулась к работе на кухне."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and smiled."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и улыбнулась."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and thanked Garret for his help so far."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и поблагодарила Гаррета за помощь."

#. emotion: Nervously stepping away
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and turned to leave."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и повернулась, чтобы уйти."

#. emotion: Delicately amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded and walked away."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и ушла."

#. emotion: Cautiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as Kate continued to list all the items they needed to set out."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, пока Кейт перечисляла всё, что им нужно было для выступления."

#. emotion: Tenderly, with fondness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as Metis spoke."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, слушая Метиса."

#. emotion: Nervously anticipating
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she began to eat."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, принимаясь за еду."

#. emotion: With intrigued amusement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she began to feel her body rock back and forth from Belmont's thrusts."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, чувствуя, как её тело раскачивается вперёд-назад от толчков Белмонта."

#. emotion: Reflectively attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she contemplated what Sophia was telling her."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, обдумывая то, что говорила ей София."

#. emotion: Nodding eagerly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she eagerly accepted the second piece of bread."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, с готовностью принимая второй кусок."

#. emotion: Romantically entranced
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she felt herself entranced by the bloodied hand, moving, motioning."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, чувствуя себя заворожённой окровавленной рукой, движущейся, жестикулирующей."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she listened intently."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, внимательно слушая."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she listened to him explain."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, слушая его объяснения."

#. emotion: Attentively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she listened."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, слушая."

#. emotion: Softly reflective
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she looked at the window, moonlight falling in."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, глядя в окно, куда падал лунный свет."

#. emotion: With a gentle, affectionate nod
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she read the letter."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, читая письмо."

#. emotion: Nodding attentively
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she sat down opposite of him."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, садясь напротив него."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she studied the map."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, изучая карту."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as she tried to keep up with Jasmine."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, пытаясь не отставать от Жасмин."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as the voice explained."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, пока голос объяснял."

#. emotion: Calmly content
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded as they silently moved about."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, и они бесшумно двинулись."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded at the correction."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, принимая поправку."

#. emotion: With anticipation, eagerly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded excitedly."
msgstr "Сара взволнованно кивнула."

#. emotion: Annoyed, slightly mocking
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head, afraid to anger the orc any further."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, боясь разозлить орка ещё больше."

#. emotion: Contentedly, with pride
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head, lowered her eyes, and continued her work."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, опустила глаза и продолжила своё дело."

#. emotion: Surprised and delighted
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head."
msgstr "Сара кивнула."

#. emotion: Softly impressed
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded her head. Lady Carolyn was right."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Леди Кэролайн была права."

#. emotion: Nodding with agreement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded in agreement."
msgstr "Сара кивнула в знак согласия."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded politely."
msgstr "Сара вежливо кивнула."

#. emotion: Tenderly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded softly and pressed another kiss on her lips."
msgstr "Сара мягко кивнула и поцеловала её в губы ещё раз."

#. emotion: Calmly acquiescent
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded submissively."
msgstr "Сара покорно кивнула."

#. emotion: Nodding attentively
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded to each."
msgstr "Сара кивнула каждому."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, absentmindedly."
msgstr "Сара рассеянно кивнула."

#. emotion: Nervously anticipating response
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, acknowledging the servant."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, приветствуя слугу."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and began to refill his cup again."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и снова начала наполнять его чашу."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and grabbed onto Kim's hands more firmly."
msgstr "Сара кивнула и взяла Ким за руку крепче."

#. emotion: Tenderly curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and her friend left the tent."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, и подруга вышла из шатра."

#. emotion: Nodding respectfully
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, bowing deep before the captain."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, глубоко поклонившись капитану."

#. emotion: Calmly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, but said nothing."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, но ничего не сказала."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, but she was not entirely convinced."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, но не была до конца убеждена."

#. emotion: Reflectively listening
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, contemplating all that Lady Carolyn had told her."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, обдумывая всё, что рассказала ей леди Кэролайн."

#. emotion: Warmly, with encouragement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, eager for work."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, стремясь заняться работой."

#. emotion: Slightly embarrassed, with appreciation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, eager to be able to be of use to the group, repay them for helping her get along."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, стремясь быть полезной группе, отплатить им за помощь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, even though she had never touched a stove in her life."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, хотя в жизни не прикасалась к плите."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, feeling oddly grateful that he had decided to end his torture here."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, чувствуя странную благодарность, что он решил прекратить пытку."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, grateful for her friend."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, благодарная своей подруге."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, gratefully."
msgstr "Сара благодарно кивнула."

#. emotion: Playfully mocking
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, mockingly."
msgstr "Сара насмешливо кивнула."

#. emotion: Casually dismissive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, putting on a brave face."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, напуская на себя храбрый вид."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, realizing she quickly saw the same that he did."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, понимая, что быстро заметила то же, что и он."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, remembering everything that had happened that day."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, вспоминая всё, что случилось в тот день."

#. emotion: Energetically encouraging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, resolute."
msgstr "Сара решительно кивнула."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, she knew that much to be true."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, она знала, что это правда."

#. emotion: Contentedly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, she'd long come to accept the same."
msgstr "Сара кивнула: она давно пришла к тому же."

#. emotion: Calm satisfaction
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, showing him she understood."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, показывая, что поняла."

#. emotion: Nodding with conviction
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, simply because that was what she knew he wanted from him."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, просто потому что знала — он хочет именно этого."

#. emotion: In a flat, detached manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, stepping forward."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, шагнув вперёд."

#. emotion: Tentatively optimistic
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, still hestitant."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, всё ещё колеблясь."

#. emotion: Nodding with genuine warmth and satisfaction
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, still smiling."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, всё ещё улыбаясь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, that seemed smart enough."
msgstr "Сара кивнула — это звучало достаточно разумно."

#. emotion: Solemnly, with resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, then lowered her head and resumed her work."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, опустила голову и продолжила."

#. emotion: Confidently accepting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, there was no real point in denying that he was right."
msgstr "Сара кивнула — не было смысла отрицать, что он прав."

#. emotion: Inquisitively questioning, with mild confusion
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she couldn't relate to what he felt."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, хотя и не могла представить, что он чувствует."

#. emotion: With a hint of nervous anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she doubted it."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, хотя сомневалась в этом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she had cleaned about as much in her life as she had cooked."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, хотя в жизни убирала примерно столько же, сколько и готовила."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she knew little of engineering."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, хотя мало что понимала в инженерии."

#. emotion: Tentatively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, though she wasn't sure if she could really let the matter rest that easy."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, хотя не была уверена, что сможет так легко оставить это дело."

#. emotion: Surprised, with relief
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, turning her eyes to the ground."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, опустив глаза."

#. emotion: Casually acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding it."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, понимая."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding that she was for the most part alone in this place."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, понимая, что она по большей части одна в этом месте."

#. emotion: With a mix of curiosity and admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding where he was going."
msgstr "Сара кивнула, понимая, к чему он клонит."

#. emotion: Softly appreciative
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, understanding."
msgstr "Сара понимающе кивнула."

#. emotion: Softly admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, wordlessly."
msgstr "Сара молча кивнула."

#. emotion: In a playful, teasing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded."
msgstr "Сара кивнула."

#. emotion: Tense admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. He could not afford to be made to look weak."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Он не мог позволить себе выглядеть слабым."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. He wasn't wrong."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Он был прав."

#. emotion: With mild respect
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. It seemed the safest choice."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Это казалось самым безопасным решением."

#. emotion: Attentively admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. It sounded vain, but she wasn't unaware of it."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Это звучало тщеславно, но она отдавала себе в этом отчёт."

#. emotion: Neutrally observant
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Many of them still harbored their hatreds for the march through the desert."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Многие всё ещё питали ненависть за марш через пустыню."

#. emotion: In a casual, reassuring nod
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Of course, she thought. Of course he would charge them. He was just as Alaric had warned her."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Конечно, подумала она. Конечно, он возьмёт с них плату. Всё именно так, как предупреждал её Аларик."

#. emotion: In a contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Perhaps she had pressed her luck too far with him."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Возможно, она слишком испытывала его терпение."

#. emotion: Attentively delivering with slight admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Rosanna was part of the union, so she was more familiar with it than any of them might guess to know."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Розанна была частью союза, так что она знала о нём больше, чем кто-либо из них мог предположить."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She couldn't do much else but agree with him. They were in this together now."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Ей ничего не оставалось, кроме как согласиться. Теперь они были в этом вместе."

#. emotion: Casually uninterested
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She didn't know why that was important."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она не понимала, почему это важно."

#. emotion: Disguised sadness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She didn't want it to be true, but it was."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Ей не хотелось, чтобы это было правдой, но так оно и было."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She doubted he needed any hand at all."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она сомневалась, что ему вообще нужна помощь."

#. emotion: "Warmly, with pride"
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She felt proud enough about her achievement."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она чувствовала гордость за своё достижение."

#. emotion: With a playful wink and a smile
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She had forgotten herself, she realized."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она забылась, осознала она."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She had only ever imagined cities to be permanent, like the capital back in Rosanna."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она всегда представляла города вечными, как столицу в Розанне."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She heard whispers."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она слышала шёпот."

#. emotion: Quietly acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She imagined her own concerns to run deeper, but she was happy to realize she wasn't the only one that wanted to leave."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Ей казалось, что её собственные тревоги глубже, но она была рада осознать, что не она одна хотела уйти."

#. emotion: Nodding with hopeful anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She just hoped it was true, for his sake."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она просто надеялась, что это правда, ради него."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She knew it was the truth."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она знала, что это правда."

#. emotion: With a heavy sigh and a hint of regret
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She knew she'd made a mistake."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она знала, что совершила ошибку."

#. emotion: Calmly acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She knew the story well by now."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она уже хорошо знала эту историю."

#. emotion: Softly, with genuine warmth
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She meant every word of it."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она говорила совершенно искренне."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She tried to keep her mind from running wild."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она пыталась не дать разуму разыграться."

#. emotion: Contentedly nodding
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. She wanted much the same."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Она хотела того же."

#. emotion: Calmly acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. This part too, she had heard."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Эту часть она тоже слышала."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Those had been beautiful."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Они были прекрасны."

#. emotion: In a resigned tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded. Whatever disgust she might feel was meaningless. She could do nothing to stop it."
msgstr "Сара кивнула. Какое бы отвращение она ни чувствовала, это было бессмысленно. Она ничего не могла с этим поделать."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nods, knowing not what else to say."
msgstr "Сара кивает, не зная, что ещё сказать."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nods."
msgstr "Сара кивает."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed Kate turning more quiet, more inward."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что Кейт становится тише, уходит в себя."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed Sakar was carrying nothing, leaving Krip to do the heavy lifting."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что Сакар ничего не нёс, оставив всю тяжёлую работу Крипу."

#. emotion: Intrigued and admiring
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed a ring on Hassar's finger, glowing with a bright crimson glow."
msgstr "Сара заметила кольцо на пальце Хассара, светящееся ярким багровым сиянием."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed from the corners of her eyes that Ephraim had at some point taken off his clothes and was now naked."
msgstr "Краем глаз Сара заметила, что Эфраим где-то разделся и теперь гол."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed he was quickly changing the subject from where he was going, back to her lessons."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что он быстро перевёл тему с того, куда направляется, обратно на её уроки."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed her staring just a moment too long."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что та засмотрелась чуть дольше положенного."

#. emotion: Attentively curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed him as he walked."
msgstr "Сара заметила это, пока он шёл."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed his broad steps, how he held up his sword, ready to strike. There was no hestitation."
msgstr "Сара заметила его широкие шаги, как он держал меч, готовый к удару. Никаких колебаний."

#. emotion: Admiringly attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed how Carolyn carried herself. She exuded an air of supreme confidence in herself. As if there was no doubt that she belonged on the council."
msgstr "Сара заметила, как держалась Каролин. Она излучала абсолютную уверенность в себе. Будто не было никаких сомнений, что её место в совете."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed how Kate had lingered on the word wife. As if there was some special significance to that fact."
msgstr "Сара заметила, как Кейт задержалась на слове «жена». Будто в этом был какой-то особый смысл."

#. emotion: With curious observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed it wasn't only the women who suffered the soldier's desires."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что не только женщины страдали от желаний солдат."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed something off about him. Her heart began to race. Something was wrong."
msgstr "Сара заметила в нём что-то странное. Её сердце забилось быстрее. Что-то было не так."

#. emotion: In a neutral, attentive observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that Kate had gotten angrier."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что Кейт разозлилась ещё больше."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that Samayra was looking directly at her."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что Самайра смотрит прямо на неё."

#. emotion: Surprised but intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that fact. It was an odd thing to notice."
msgstr "Сара заметила это. Странно, что она заметила именно это."

#. emotion: Nodding thoughtfully
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that he had called her princess. She imagined Kate had told Vaelen more or less everything."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что он назвал её принцессой. Она предположила, что Кейт рассказала Ваэлену практически всё."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that he had not yet noticed her."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что он ещё не заметил её."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that he was agitated."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что он взволнован."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed that the orc was holding a package."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что орк держит свёрток."

#. emotion: Concerned observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed the heavy stains of sweat on his clothes. He had worked himself to the bone again."
msgstr "Сара заметила тёмные пятна пота на его одежде. Он снова работал до изнеможения."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed the way she carried herself."
msgstr "Сара заметила, как она держалась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed the woman was smiling at her."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что женщина улыбается ей."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah noticed this had happened every time."
msgstr "Сара заметила, что это происходило каждый раз."

#. emotion: Calm understanding
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah now realized that as heavy as the blows had been so far, in truth, Atilla had still been holding back."
msgstr "Сара теперь поняла: какими бы сильными ни были удары, на самом деле Атилла всё ещё сдерживался."

#. emotion: In a quiet, obedient manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obediently turned her body around, laying down on her stomach."
msgstr "Сара послушно перевернулась, ложась на живот."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed every instruction, as the ritual played out around her."
msgstr "Сара подчинялась каждому указанию."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed her new mentor."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась новому наставнику."

#. emotion: Confidently acknowledging
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed him."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась ему."

#. emotion: Reluctantly accepting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed him. Part of her enjoyed the simplicity that being with the captain offered. Simply doing as you're told."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась. Часть её наслаждалась простотой, которую предлагали отношения с капитаном. Просто делать, что тебе говорят."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed his instructions."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась."

#. emotion: Contentedly compliant
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed, as best she could."
msgstr "Сара подчинялась, как могла."

#. emotion: Calmly accepting, with resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed, walking out into the middle of the cargo room."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась, выйдя на середину грузового отсека."

#. emotion: Confused hesitation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась."

#. emotion: Nodding in reverence
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obeyed. Whenever she was alone with Lady Carolyn, obeying became like second nature."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась. Когда бы она ни была наедине с леди Кэролин, послушание становилось второй натурой."

#. emotion: Surprised softly
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obliged her."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась."

#. emotion: Calm resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah obliged."
msgstr "Сара подчинилась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed Marius as she followed him."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за Мариусом, пока шла за ним."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed Xan. He was always so different when they left the house. Out here in the real world."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за Ксаном. Он всегда был таким другим, когда они покидали дом. Здесь, в реальном мире."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed her. Her body, though older, bore it well. There was a firmness to it, the kind that could only be produced by a lifetime of physical labour."
msgstr "Сара разглядывала её. Её тело, хоть и старше, выглядело хорошо. В нём чувствовалась крепость, которую мог дать только многолетний физический труд."

#. emotion: In a detached, curious manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed him for a moment."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за ним мгновение."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed him, the quiet confidence he exuded whilst sitting in the chair reminded her of someone."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за ним — тихая уверенность, которую он излучал, сидя в кресле, напомнила ей кое-кого."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed him."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за ним."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed him. How much of this was real. How much performance. Sarah wasn't sure of it."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за ним. Сколько в этом правды, а сколько игры? Она не была уверена."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the creature. It had no face, and with it, no hints as to whether it spoke truth or lie."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за существом. У него не было лица, а значит, и намёков на то, говорит ли оно правду или лжёт."

#. emotion: Surprised, reflecting on past mistake
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the man again. She was surprised by how wrong her initial impression of him proved to be."
msgstr "Сара снова оглядела мужчину. Она была удивлена, насколько ошибочным оказалось её первое впечатление."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the man as he spoke."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за мужчиной, пока он говорил."

#. emotion: Casually intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the man for a moment."
msgstr "Сара смотрела на мужчину мгновение."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the man."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за мужчиной."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the man. Given his proportions, she didn't doubt it."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за мужчиной. Учитывая его габариты, она не сомневалась."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the pair from a distance before she made her approach."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за парой издалека, прежде чем подойти."

#. emotion: In a curious observing manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the room as she walked in."
msgstr "Сара осмотрела комнату, войдя внутрь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the soldier's playing their game for a while longer, then continued her walk."
msgstr "Сара понаблюдала за игрой солдат ещё немного, затем продолжила путь."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the spirit for a moment."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за духом мгновение."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the spirit."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за духом."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observed the spirit. Its intentions, much like its shape, were hard to grasp."
msgstr "Сара наблюдала за духом. Его намерения, как и его форма, было трудно уловить."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah observes the man."
msgstr "Сара разглядывает мужчину."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah occasionally let out a high pitched squeal."
msgstr "Сара время от времени издавала пронзительный визг."

#. emotion: With a hint of sadness and resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered a pained smile."
msgstr "Сара выдавила болезненную улыбку."

#. emotion: Deliberately contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered her wish silently to an empty room."
msgstr "Сара безмолвно обратила своё желание к пустой комнате."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered to give the cloak back, but now, sitting in the snow-covered garden, she was happy he had been too polite to accept."
msgstr "Сара предлагала вернуть плащ, но теперь, сидя в заснеженном саду, радовалась, что он был слишком вежлив, чтобы согласиться."

#. emotion: Anxiously uncertain
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered up her meek response, but in this instance, she cared not for the Khan, only for Naydeen."
msgstr "Сара дала робкий ответ, но в этот момент ей было всё равно на хана — только на Найдин."

#. emotion: Warmly, with a hint of admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered up her meek response, but it was the truth."
msgstr "Сара дала робкий ответ, но это была правда."

#. emotion: Nodding thoughtfully
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered up the truth as though it was a confession."
msgstr "Сара выдала правду, будто это было признание."

#. emotion: In a humble, respectful whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offered up the words as meekly as she could. Submission, that was what he wanted, and that was what she had to give him."
msgstr "Сара произнесла эти слова как можно смиреннее. Покорность — вот чего он хотел, и вот что она должна была ему дать."

#. emotion: In a soft, contented whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah offers a small laugh."
msgstr "Сара тихо смеётся."

#. emotion: Surprised exhaustion
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah on barely managed to make it to the bedroom before collapsing into the bed."
msgstr "Сара едва успела добраться до спальни, прежде чем рухнуть на кровать."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only arched her back and stuck out her rear to accomodate him."
msgstr "Сара только выгнула спину и выставила зад, чтобы приспособиться к нему."

#. emotion: Tentatively and with restrained admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only breathed heavily, recovering from the beast's urges and desires."
msgstr "Сара лишь тяжело дышала, приходя в себя после животной похоти."

#. emotion: Reflective curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only grinned back as she continued lowering herself, taking him deeper and deeper inside herself."
msgstr "Сара только ухмыльнулась в ответ, продолжая опускаться, принимая его всё глубже и глубже."

#. emotion: Anxiously awaiting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only had a brief moment to herself before one of her officers came to collect her."
msgstr "У Сары была лишь короткая минута наедине с собой, прежде чем один из её офицеров пришёл за ней."

#. emotion: Intrigued and amused
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only heard Samayra laugh as she continued to run."
msgstr "Сара только услышала смех Самайры, когда та продолжила бежать."

#. emotion: Tense curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only knew surrender in this moment."
msgstr "В этот момент Сара знала только покорность."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only laughed as she offered up a weak resistance to her husband's renewed advances."
msgstr "Сара лишь рассмеялась, оказывая слабое сопротивление возобновившимся приставаниям мужа."

#. emotion: Quietly submissive, with a hint of desperation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only meekly nodded, praying the spirit would not let go of her."
msgstr "Сара лишь покорно кивнула, молясь, чтобы дух не отпускал её."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only moaned louder at his humiliations."
msgstr "Сара только громче застонала от его унижений."

#. emotion: Softly reflecting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only nodded as she felt the water rush across her body, wiping away the sand and sweat."
msgstr "Сара лишь кивнула, чувствуя, как вода струится по телу, смывая песок и пот."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only nodded in response, still recovering her breath."
msgstr "Сара лишь кивнула в ответ, всё ещё восстанавливая дыхание."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only nodded, and made some affirmative sound."
msgstr "Сара лишь кивнула, издав утвердительный звук."

#. emotion: In a reflective, contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only nodded, her face bright red."
msgstr "Сара лишь кивнула, заливаясь краской."

#. emotion: Nervously hesitant
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only nodded, unable to say the word."
msgstr "Сара только кивнула, не в силах произнести это слово."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only nodded."
msgstr "Сара только кивнула."

#. emotion: With sudden realization
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only now realized she had not been breathing the entire time."
msgstr "Сара только сейчас осознала, что всё это время не дышала."

#. emotion: Softly hopeful, with relief
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only prayed she would not get lost on the way back to the camp."
msgstr "Сара только молилась, чтобы не заблудиться по пути в лагерь."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah only repositioned herself to make it easier for him to do so."
