#. emotion: Alertly intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's mind was spinning. The mystery of her father's death only grew, now Kate revealed herself to be her father's secret agent...and now she had to leave in the dead of night."
msgstr "Мысли Сары путались. Тайна смерти отца обрастала новыми загадками, Кейт оказалась его тайным агентом... а теперь нужно бежать посреди ночи."

#. emotion: Detached bemusement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's mind, clouded from the drinks, suddenly sobered up."
msgstr "Разум Сары, затуманенный выпивкой, внезапно протрезвел."

#. emotion: Neutral observation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's moans filled up the tent as he ravaged her on the desk."
msgstr "Стоны Сары наполнили шатёр, пока он брал её на столе."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's moans had turned to whimpers, and she now only slowly arched her back into Kate's fingers."
msgstr "Стоны Сары превратились в хныканье, и теперь она лишь медленно выгибала спину навстречу пальцам Кейт."

#. emotion: Suspiciously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's movements first contrained, now grew wilder as she incorporated her whole body into the performance."
msgstr "Движения Сары, сначала сдержанные, теперь становились всё более дикими — она включила в танец всё тело."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's nails dug into the edges of the wooden desk."
msgstr "Ногти Сары впились в края деревянного стола."

#. emotion: Tiredly accepting reality
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's natural instinct was to cover her body, though she knew it was meaningless before this man who had already seen her naked."
msgstr "Инстинкт Сары требовал прикрыть тело, хотя она знала, что это бессмысленно перед мужчиной, который уже видел её обнажённой."

#. emotion: With weary exhaustion
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's own muscles were screaming from the exertion."
msgstr "Мышцы Сары кричали от напряжения."

#. emotion: Cautiously hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's position was still weak. She understood that Maeiv was simply refusing to commit herself to either side, so that she could be friendly with whichever side ended up winning."
msgstr "Позиция Сары всё ещё была слабой. Она понимала, что Мейв просто отказывается принимать чью-либо сторону, чтобы потом подружиться с победителем."

#. emotion: Admiring, with a hint of pride
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's royal upbringing had taught her reading and writing, but also taught her the subtleties of politics and leadership."
msgstr "Королевское воспитание Сары научило её чтению и письму, а также тонкостям политики и лидерства."

#. emotion: Nervously anticipating failure
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's struggled, but the iron was unyielding."
msgstr "Сара рванулась, но железо было неподатливым."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's tone had grown more serious. Half a question, half an accusation. How could you leave me like that, she wanted to ask."
msgstr "Голос Сары стал серьёзнее. Вопрос пополам с упрёком. Как ты могла так меня бросить — хотелось ей спросить."

#. emotion: With genuine curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice became genuinely curious."
msgstr "Голос Сары стал искренне заинтересованным."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice grew hoarse as she fucked her increasingly fast."
msgstr "Голос Сары охрип, пока она трахала её всё быстрее."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice had gone quiet. It was slowly dawning on her what she had become."
msgstr "Голос Сары стих. До неё медленно доходило, кем она стала."

#. emotion: In a trembling, pleading tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice nearly broke as she begged him."
msgstr "Голос Сары почти сорвался, пока она умоляла его."

#. emotion: Passionately, with fervor
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice pounded with magical rage, echoing far and wide throught the massive streets of the city."
msgstr "Голос Сары гремел магической яростью, разносясь далеко по огромным улицам города."

#. emotion: Intrigued amazement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice rang out and all were silenced, their eyes falling on her."
msgstr "Голос Сары прозвенел, и все замолчали, их взгляды упали на неё."

#. emotion: Resignedly supportive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice sounded low and pathetic to her. But for him, she was eager to submit."
msgstr "Голос Сары показался ей самой низким и жалким. Но ради него она была готова подчиниться."

#. emotion: In a low menacing whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice trailed off, fearing almost to speak it."
msgstr "Голос Сары затих, она почти боялась произнести это."

#. emotion: Softly spoken, with tenderness
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice was soft as a whisper."
msgstr "Голос Сары был тихим, как шёпот."

#. emotion: With a gentle, soothing tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's voice was soft."
msgstr "Голос Сары был тихим."

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's whole body was alight with blind desire and pleasure."
msgstr "Всё тело Сары пылало слепым желанием и наслаждением."

#. emotion: Sharp urgency
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's words came hard and fast."
msgstr "Слова Сары прозвучали резко и быстро."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's words seemed to lift Varga's spirits."
msgstr "Слова Сары, казалось, подняли настроение Варге."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah's words were genuine. She was truly happy that it wouldn't come to any bloodshed."
msgstr "Слова Сары были искренними. Она была по-настоящему счастлива, что дело не дойдёт до кровопролития."

#. emotion: Tenderly reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah, I had one great love in my life. To have met you and found another, it is more than I could have ever asked for..."
msgstr "Сара, у меня была одна великая любовь. Встретить тебя и найти другую — больше, чем я мог просить..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, I have to leave. Every part of me wants to stay here, but if they found us..."
msgstr "Сара, я должен уйти. Каждая частичка меня хочет остаться, но если нас найдут..."

#. emotion: Emotionally detached, with slight sarcasm
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, I keep telling you this but you're not listening."
msgstr "Сара, я твержу тебе это, но ты не слушаешь."

#. emotion: In a reflective, almost reverent tone
msgctxt "speaker:Judge"
msgid "Sarah, I thought myself dead before I met you."
msgstr "Сара, я считал себя мёртвым до встречи с тобой."

#. emotion: Warily observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah, I told you that this road gets dangerous the further we get along."
msgstr "Сара, я говорил тебе, что эта дорога становится опаснее, чем дальше мы продвигаемся."

#. emotion: Sternly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "Sarah, I understand that her story plays on your soft nature."
msgstr "Сара, я понимаю, что её история играет на твоей мягкой натуре."

#. emotion: Comfortingly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Naydeen"
msgid "Sarah, I understand you have your reservations. It is only natural."
msgstr "Сара, я понимаю твои сомнения. Это совершенно естественно."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Sarah, I urge you, please! When Carolyn offers you our contract, you must take it!"
msgstr "Сара, умоляю тебя, пожалуйста! Когда Кэролин предложит тебе наш контракт, ты должна его принять!"

#. emotion: Cautiously concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah, I warned you. You're pushing yourself."
msgstr "Сара, я предупреждал тебя. Ты переусердствуешь."

#. emotion: Tenuously guarded, as if fearing exposure
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Sarah, I would appreciate if you could keep everything that you saw today private."
msgstr "Сара, я был бы признателен, если бы ты сохранила в тайне всё, что видела сегодня."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Sarah, I'm not, really."
msgstr "Сара, я не дразню, правда."

#. emotion: Softly apologetic
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, I'm so sorry."
msgstr "Сара, мне так жаль."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Sarah, I-"
msgstr "Сара, я-"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah, I..."
msgstr "Сара, я..."

#. emotion: In a hushed, tearful whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, I...when I heard the screams coming from the throne room, I thought I'd lose you..."
msgstr "Сара, я... когда услышала крики из тронного зала, я думала, что потеряю тебя..."

#. emotion: In a trembling state of desperation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, almost hysterical, began bucking against him, wordlessly begging the orc to take her deeper and faster."
msgstr "Сара, почти обезумевшая, начала насаживаться на него, без слов умоляя орка взять её глубже и быстрее."

#. emotion: In a warm, admiring tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, along with the others, quickly followed."
msgstr "Сара вместе с остальными быстро последовала за ней."

#. emotion: Quietly intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Mary"
msgid "Sarah, be very quiet."
msgstr "Сара, тихо."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, beautiful and young, had captured the interest of a tribesmen soldier some time in the third week."
msgstr "Сара, красивая и молодая, привлекла внимание солдата из племени где-то на третьей неделе."

#. emotion: Sarcasm tinged with irritation
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sarah, by the way. Since you forgot to ask before you stuck it in me."
msgstr "Сара, кстати. Раз уж ты забыл спросить, прежде чем засунуть его в меня."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Sarah, can I speak with you in your room?"
msgstr "Сара, могу я поговорить с тобой в твоей комнате?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, closer than anyone else, noticed a single tear crawling down the emissary's cheek."
msgstr "Сара, ближе всех стоявшая к ним, заметила одинокую слезу, ползущую по щеке эмиссара."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "Sarah, come with me."
msgstr "Сара, идём со мной."

#. emotion: Suspiciously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, didn't stop him."
msgstr "Сара не остановила его."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Sarah, dinner please."
msgstr "Сара, ужин, пожалуйста."

#. emotion: Confusedly glancing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, distracted, misplaces her foot used in the landing."
msgstr "Сара, отвлёкшись, неверно ставит ногу для приземления."

#. emotion: Firmly, reassuringly
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Sarah, don't get hysterical now."
msgstr "Сара, не впадай в истерику."

#. emotion: Cautiously advising, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah, don't push yourself. Remember what I said."
msgstr "Сара, не переусердствуй. Помни, что я говорил."

#. emotion: Calmly reassuring
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "Sarah, don't worry."
msgstr "Сара, не волнуйся."

#. emotion: Fatigued and collapsing beside him
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, exhausted, collapsed next to him."
msgstr "Сара, истощённая, рухнула рядом с ним."

#. emotion: Surprised, with disbelief
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, feeling caught out, looks away."
msgstr "Сара, чувствуя себя застигнутой, отводит взгляд."

#. emotion: Reluctantly accepting
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for all of it, endured it."
msgstr "Сара, несмотря ни на что, терпела."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, committed herself to the task of stroking the captain to completion."
msgstr "Сара, со своей стороны, посвятила себя задаче довести капитана до конца руками."

#. emotion: Cautiously attentive
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, committed herself to the task. As she masturbated him, she listened to the sounds he made, the movements of his body."
msgstr "Сара, со своей стороны, сосредоточилась на деле. Пока она дрочила его, она прислушивалась к звукам, которые он издавал, и движениям его тела."

#. emotion: In a focused yet somewhat detached manner
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, focussed on her own footwork."
msgstr "Сара, со своей стороны, сосредоточилась на работе ног."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, found it impossible to look away from Kate."
msgstr "Сара, со своей стороны, не могла отвести взгляд."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, leans back into Kate, letting her continue going down on her."
msgstr "Сара откидывается назад к Кейт, позволяя ей и дальше ласкать себя языком."

#. emotion: In a warm, affectionate tone
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, simply walked about the house, inspecting it."
msgstr "Сара же просто ходила по дому, осматривая его."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, spoke it half veiled truths, trying to be as honest as she could be with him."
msgstr "Сара, в свою очередь, говорила полуправду, стараясь быть настолько честной с ним, насколько могла."

#. emotion: Cautiously intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, still felt every nerve in her body."
msgstr "Сара, со своей стороны, всё ещё чувствовала каждый нерв в своём теле."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, tried as best as she could to keep up with both of them."
msgstr "Сара со своей стороны старалась изо всех сил поспевать за обоими."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, for her part, was eager to oblige."
msgstr "Сара, со своей стороны, была рада услужить."

#. emotion: Excitedly beckoning
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, get back!"
msgstr "Сара, вернись!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, grasped at her new lease on life and leapt up to her feet."
msgstr "Сара ухватилась за второй шанс и вскочила на ноги."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, having made her point, shook off the fire."
msgstr "Сара, доказав свою правоту, стряхнула огонь."

#. emotion: Intrigued and slightly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Sarah, he seeks to bait you."
msgstr "Сара, он пытается спровоцировать тебя."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Daemon"
msgid "Sarah, here."
msgstr "Сара, сюда."

#. emotion: Intrigued revelation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, however, had discovered that with surrender, there also came a certain kind of release."
msgstr "Однако Сара обнаружила, что вместе с покорностью приходит и своего рода освобождение."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, if only to not embarrass the man, accepts and puts on the cloak."
msgstr "Сара, хотя бы чтобы не смущать мужчину, принимает плащ и надевает его."

#. emotion: In a state of stunned awe
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, in a numbed state, stumbled out from behind the feasting table, onto the main stage."
msgstr "Сара, в оцепенении, вышла из-за пиршественного стола на главную сцену."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, in turn, began to weave her magical wards and barriers."
msgstr "Сара, в свою очередь, начала плести магические барьеры и защиты."

#. emotion: Disinterestedly looking away
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, instinctively, pulls herself physically away from Kate."
msgstr "Сара инстинктивно отстраняется от Кейт."

#. emotion: Affectionately praising
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah, it was not your fault, but you were right to speak to me about it."
msgstr "Сара, это не твоя вина, но ты правильно сделала, что рассказала мне."

#. emotion: Anxious, concerned delivery
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, it won't be like you remember it. The horde has ravaged the country...the capital..."
msgstr "Сара, это будет не так, как ты помнишь. Орда разорила страну... столицу..."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, it's me."
msgstr "Сара, это я."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, it's me."
msgstr "Сара, это я."

#. emotion: Anxiously pleading
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Sarah, look out!!!"
msgstr "Сара, берегись!!!"

#. emotion: In a casual, friendly tone
msgctxt "speaker:Hecate"
msgid "Sarah, me and Gabriel will need to make use of Xan's house."
msgstr "Сара, мне и Габриэлю нужно будет воспользоваться домом Ксана."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, near the vanguard of her army, was one of the first to cross over the hill."
msgstr "Сара, находившаяся рядом с авангардом своей армии, одной из первых перевалила через холм."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sarah, nice to meet you."
msgstr "Сара, приятно познакомиться."

#. emotion: Tentatively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, not knowing what to say, opted to say nothing."
msgstr "Сара, не зная, что сказать, предпочла промолчать."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, noticing where the night was leading, and full of liquid courage, took charge. She held the wine bottle up high."
msgstr "Сара, заметив, куда ведёт ночь, и полная жидкой храбрости, взяла инициативу. Она подняла бутылку."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, now with some measure of practice and instruction by Mary, had come to manage such tasks."
msgstr "Сара, имея некоторую практику и наставления Мэри, уже научилась справляться с такими задачами."

#. emotion: Intrigued with anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, on hands and knees, crawled after him."
msgstr "Сара на четвереньках поползла за ним."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, please, come with me."
msgstr "Сара, пожалуйста, поедем со мной."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Sarah, please..."
msgstr "Сара, пожалуйста..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah, promise me that you will not speak of that to him."
msgstr "Сара, пообещай мне, что ты не скажешь ему об этом."

#. emotion: Excitedly revealing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, seeing her moment, leapt out from behind Hecate's barrier."
msgstr "Сара, увидев свой момент, выпрыгнула из-за барьера Гекаты."

#. emotion: Surprised, curious
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, so distracted by Samayra's sudden bright smile, found herself startled."
msgstr "Сара, отвлёкшись на внезапную яркую улыбку Самайры, вздрогнула."

#. emotion: Attentively observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, speaking no words, reached out with her hands and one of the elder women delivered her child to her."
msgstr "Сара, не говоря ни слова, протянула руки, и одна из пожилых женщин передала ей ребёнка."

#. emotion: Tenderly assuring protection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, standing over Kate, dropped to her knees, pinning Kate between her legs, sitting on top of her stomach."
msgstr "Сара, стоя над Кейт, опустилась на колени, зажав Кейт между ног, сев на живот."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still laying on the ground, looked up, loudly panting in the aftermath of her climax."
msgstr "Сара, всё ещё лежа на полу, подняла взгляд, громко дыша после кульминации."

#. emotion: Tense anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still scared, looked up and studied the room."
msgstr "Сара, всё ещё испуганная, подняла взгляд и осмотрела комнату."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still waking, slightly nodded."
msgstr "Сара, всё ещё просыпаясь, слегка кивнула."

#. emotion: Tenderly protective
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, still wrapping her arms around Kate, could feel Kate's shoulder begin to rock."
msgstr "Сара, всё ещё обнимая Кейт за плечи, почувствовала, как её плечо начало вздрагивать."

#. emotion: In a stern, commanding tone
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah, stop!"
msgstr "Сара, остановись!"

#. emotion: Surprised exclamation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, surprised, dropped the training equipment, letting it scatter onto the floor."
msgstr "Сара, удивлённая, выронила снаряжение, рассыпав по полу."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kravel"
msgid "Sarah, the message is...it's not the concern."
msgstr "Сара, послание... не в нём дело."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, the units from the furthest provinces have arrived today."
msgstr "Сара, сегодня прибыли отряды из самых дальних провинций."

#. emotion: Wearily resigned
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah, there's so much work..."
msgstr "Сара, так много работы..."

#. emotion: Sternly accusing
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah, they will curse you behind your back. Their insults will undermine you, even as they smile to your face, they-"
msgstr "Сара, они будут проклинать тебя за спиной. Их оскорбления будут подрывать твой авторитет, даже когда они улыбаются тебе в лицо, они-"

#. emotion: Warily explaining
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Sarah, this isn't about stealing some chests of gold from an old family vault."
msgstr "Сара, дело не в краже нескольких сундуков золота из старого семейного хранилища."

#. emotion: Dispassionate yet cold dismissal
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah, this man here is Sakar. He's a mean bastard, so just try to ignore whatever shit comes out of his mouth."
msgstr "Сара, этого человека зовут Сакар. Он злобный ублюдок, так что просто старайся игнорировать всё дерьмо, что вылетает из его рта."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, together with her commanders and officers had spend weeks coming up with a strategy."
msgstr "Сара вместе со своими командирами и офицерами потратила недели на разработку стратегии."

#. emotion: Sorrowfully exhausted, retreating into rest
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, too exhausted to take part in the celebrations, returned to her bedroom and fell into a deep, restful sleep."
msgstr "Сара, слишком измученная, чтобы участвовать в празднествах, вернулась в спальню и провалилась в глубокий, спокойный сон."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, too stunned to look away at the sudden transformation, kept her eyes locked on Lady Carolyn."
msgstr "Сара, слишком ошеломлённая внезапной трансформацией, чтобы отвести взгляд, не отрывала глаз от леди Кэролин."

#. emotion: In a low, urgent whisper
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, wait!"
msgstr "Сара, подожди!"

#. emotion: Intrigued anticipation
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, waiting for the moment, lunged forward."
msgstr "Сара, выждав момент, рванулась вперёд."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Sarah, was it?"
msgstr "Сара, кажется?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, watching her brother slowly sink into his seat, decided to intervene."
msgstr "Сара, наблюдая, как брат медленно сползает на стуле, решила вмешаться."

#. emotion: In a resigned, firm tone
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, we can't go around saving everyone! It's not our place, and it's not what is meant to happen."
msgstr "Сара, мы не можем спасать всех подряд! Это не наше дело, и так не должно быть."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Sarah, we got some time till the next shift. Why don't we warm up together under the blanket?"
msgstr "Сара, у нас есть время до следующей смены. Почему бы нам не согреться вместе под одеялом?"

#. emotion: In an urgent, anxious tone
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "Sarah, we need to leave, now!"
msgstr "Сара, нам нужно уходить, сейчас же!"

#. emotion: In a flat monotone
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "Sarah, we need to-"
msgstr "Сара, нам нужно—"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah, we've arrived."
msgstr "Сара, мы прибыли."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:The Official"
msgid "Sarah, what?"
msgstr "Сара — что?"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, with little else to do, found herself following him."
msgstr "Саре, делать было особенно нечего, и она последовала за ним."

#. emotion: Concerned and earnest delivery
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Sarah, within a little more than a hundred years, every man or woman alive today, will have died of old age."
msgstr "Сара, чуть более чем через сто лет каждый мужчина или женщина, живущие сегодня, умрут от старости."

#. emotion: Attentively watching
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah, wordlessly, nodded."
msgstr "Сара молча кивнула."

#. emotion: In a firm, disappointed tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Sarah, you can't go through life with that naive attitude."
msgstr "Сара, нельзя идти по жизни с таким наивным подходом."

#. emotion: In a concerned, yet firm tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah, you don't have to do this."
msgstr "Сара, ты не обязана этого делать."

#. emotion: Sternly disappointed
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, you don't know what you're doing."
msgstr "Сара, ты не знаешь, что делаешь."

#. emotion: Somberly resigned
msgctxt "speaker:Thomas"
msgid "Sarah, you know that officially, you need my blessing for the marriage."
msgstr "Сара, ты знаешь, что официально тебе нужно моё благословение на брак."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Sarah, you must be aware that Medini has the smallest army out of all the kingdoms?"
msgstr "Сара, ты должна понимать, что у Медини самая маленькая армия из всех королевств?"

#. emotion: Urgently pleading, with a hint of desperation
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah, you need to come with me, to Lethram. It's the only place where we can keep you safe. But, we need to leave tonight, right now. There is a ship waiting for us in the harbor."
msgstr "Сара, тебе нужно ехать со мной в Летрам. Это единственное место, где ты будешь в безопасности. Но уезжать нужно сегодня, прямо сейчас. В гавани нас ждёт корабль."

#. emotion: In a stern, accusatory tone
msgctxt "speaker:Court Official"
msgid "Sarah, you stand charged with grand theft and participation in a criminal organization."
msgstr "Сара, вы обвиняетесь в крупной краже и участии в преступной организации."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Raza"
msgid "Sarah, you wake!"
msgstr "Сара, ты проснулась!"

#. emotion: Excitedly exclaiming
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Sarah, you're amazing!"
msgstr "Сара, ты потрясающая!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Sarah-from-far-away."
msgstr "Сара-издалека."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Sarah."
msgstr "Сара."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sarah."
msgstr "Сара."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sigmund"
msgid "Sarah."
msgstr "Сара."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "Sarah."
msgstr "Сара."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Sarah. I'm the head of the mercenary company."
msgstr "Сара. Я глава наёмнической роты."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Sarah. That's a nice name."
msgstr "Сара. Красивое имя."

#. emotion: Calmly assuring, tenderly
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah. You know that I would do anything for you, that I would do anything to keep you safe."
msgstr "Сара. Ты знаешь, что я сделаю для тебя что угодно, что я сделаю всё, чтобы ты была в безопасности."

#. emotion: Protectively concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Varga"
msgid "Sarah. You know that I would do anything to keep you safe."
msgstr "Сара. Ты знаешь, я сделаю всё, чтобы ты была в безопасности."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Dalia"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Ephraim"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Garret"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Marius"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Metis"
msgid "Sarah..."
msgstr "Сара..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Oryon"
msgid "Sarah..."
