#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked into the soldier's hands and watched the bone-totems he kept palmed."
msgstr "Она заглянула в руки солдата, рассматривая костяные тотемы, которые он прятал в ладони."

#. emotion: Intrigued with childlike wonder
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
