#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked out through the window."
msgstr "Она выглянула в окно."

#. emotion: Intrigued, with a hint of longing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked over at Alaric again."
msgstr "Она снова взглянула на Аларика."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked over towards Belmont."
msgstr "Она посмотрела на Белмонта."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked so out of place, a worried expression on her face. She softly nodded towards Sarah for encouragement."
msgstr "Она выглядела так неуместно, с обеспокоенным лицом. Она мягко кивнула Саре в знак поддержки."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked straight at the girl to make sure that she was listening."
msgstr "Она посмотрела прямо на девочку, убеждаясь, что та слушает."

#. emotion: Softly, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
