#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slowly, the creature began to walk, moving, reacting to her. It wandered a small distance from the herd."
msgstr "Медленно существо начало двигаться, реагируя на неё. Оно отошло на небольшое расстояние от стада."

#. emotion: Tenderly, with a sense of wonder
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
