#. emotion: Reflectively contemplative
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slowly, their cheers drifted away to whispers, and finally to silence."
msgstr "Медленно их крики стихли до шёпота и наконец до полной тишины."

#. emotion: Calmly reminiscing
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
