#. emotion: Neutral observation, with a hint of doubt
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The greatest city in the world, and today, it might as well have been nothing at all to her."
msgstr "Величайший город в мире, и сегодня он для неё мог бы быть ничем."

#. emotion: Reflectively somber
