#. emotion: Annoyed but patient
msgctxt "speaker:Kate"
msgid "You didn't answer my question."
msgstr "Ты не ответила на мой вопрос."

#. emotion: Annoyed but patient
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You didn't answer my question."
msgstr "Ты не ответила на мой вопрос."

#. emotion: Flatly factual
