msgstr "Ты его не любила?"

#. emotion: Confidently stating
msgctxt "speaker:Nickolas"
msgid "You didn't need to tell me."
msgstr "Тебе и не нужно было говорить."

#. emotion: Inquisitively hopeful
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You didn't really think you were winning, did you?"
msgstr "Ты ведь не думала, что выигрываешь?"

#. emotion: In a concerned and slightly anxious tone
