#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Servant"
msgid "You're beautiful, my Lady. The dress fits you perfectly."
msgstr "Вы прекрасны, моя леди. Платье сидит на вас идеально."

#. emotion: Delightfully amazed
msgctxt "speaker:Jaeid"
msgid "You're beautiful."
msgstr "Ты прекрасна."

#. emotion: Delightfully amazed
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "You're beautiful."
msgstr "Ты прекрасна."

#. emotion: Delightfully amazed
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You're beautiful."
msgstr "Ты прекрасна."

#. emotion: Softly, admiringly
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're beautiful..."
