msgstr "Ты странная, Сара. Просто скажи мне, кто он."

#. emotion: Calmly, with resignation
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You're both princesses, that's a start."
msgstr "Вы обе принцессы, это уже начало."

#. emotion: Solemnly shocked
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're calling your future queen a fool? People have been hanged for less."
msgstr "Ты называешь свою будущую королеву дурой? Людей вешали и за меньшее."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Gilead"
msgid "You're clever enough to know the answer, no?"
msgstr "Вы достаточно умны, чтобы знать ответ, не так ли?"

#. emotion: Softly with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Voice"
msgid "You're close."
msgstr "Ты близко."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're coming with me, aren't you?"
msgstr "Ты ведь идёшь со мной?"

#. emotion: Coldly amused
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're cynical."
msgstr "Ты цинична."

#. emotion: In a low, disdainful hiss
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're disgusting!"
msgstr "Ты отвратителен!"

#. emotion: Harshly rejecting
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're disgusting, you really are."
msgstr "Ты отвратителен, правда."

#. emotion: Harsh disappointment
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr "Ты отвратителен."

#. emotion: Nodding confidently
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're doing alright with all this?"
msgstr "Ты справляешься со всем этим?"

#. emotion: Determinedly assuring, with encouragement
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're doing the best you can, Ephraim. Don't feel guilty."
msgstr "Ты делаешь всё, что можешь, Эфраим. Не чувствуй вины."

#. emotion: Surprised curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're done. Can I go now?"
msgstr "Ты закончил. Я могу идти?"

#. emotion: In a concerned and inquisitive tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're down a man. Did something happen?"
msgstr "У тебя не хватает одного человека. Что-то случилось?"

#. emotion: With slight amusement
msgctxt "speaker:Xanthippe"
msgid "You're dressed like royalty, but you're sleeping out in the streets? That's a new one for me."
msgstr "Ты одета как королевская особа, но спишь на улице? Это для меня в новинку."

#. emotion: With disdainful contempt
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're drunk, go back to your room."
msgstr "Ты пьяна, иди к себе."

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "You're drunk. Go back to your room."
msgstr "Ты пьяна. Иди к себе."

#. emotion: Detached curiosity
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're drunk. I don't think this is a good idea..."
msgstr "Ты пьяна. Не думаю, что это хорошая идея..."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sakar"
msgid "You're enjoying yourself?"
msgstr "Тебе нравится?"

#. emotion: Gently, with concern
msgctxt "speaker:Carolyn"
msgid "You're far too tired, dear. You need to rest up."
msgstr "Ты слишком устала, дорогая. Тебе нужно отдохнуть."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're father is very kind."
msgstr "Твой отец очень добр."

#. emotion: Tentatively hopeful
