#. emotion: Surprised, intrigued
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're from Rosanna?"
msgstr "Ты из Розанны?"

#. emotion: Surprised, playful teasing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You're fucking right I am, blondie."
msgstr "Чёрт возьми, да, я твой муж, блондиночка."

#. emotion: Surprised yet playful
msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "You're fun, Sarah."
