msgid "You're good at making apologies, Sarah."
msgstr "Ты хорошо умеешь извиняться, Сара."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You're good for something, at least."
msgstr "Ты на что-то годишься, по крайней мере."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're happy."
msgstr "Ты счастлива."

#. emotion: Disapprovingly disapproving
msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You're having a bad influence on me."
msgstr "Ты плохо на меня влияешь."

#. emotion: In a warm, inviting tone
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You're here on my ship and you live by my rules."
msgstr "Ты здесь, на моём корабле, и живёшь по моим правилам."

#. emotion: Suspiciously accusing
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You're here to steal from me. To go back on your contract, ya signed word. Treason. Mutiny."
msgstr "Ты здесь, чтобы украсть у меня. Нарушить свой контракт, честное слово. Измена. Мятеж."

#. emotion: In a satisfied, relieved tone
msgctxt "speaker:Vaelen"
msgid "You're here, finally. Give me the status on our supplies."
msgstr "Ты здесь, наконец. Доложи о состоянии припасов."

#. emotion: Welcoming with a hint of surprise
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You're here."
msgstr "Ты здесь."

#. emotion: In a respectful, almost reverent tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're highborn too, you know?"
msgstr "Ты тоже высокородная, знаешь?"

#. emotion: Tenderly concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "You're home."
msgstr "Ты дома."

#. emotion: In a stern, disappointed tone
msgctxt "speaker:Gideon"
msgid "You're in a foul mood."
msgstr "У тебя отвратительное настроение."

#. emotion: Surprised yet concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Guard Captain"
msgid "You're in a lot of trouble."
msgstr "У тебя большие неприятности."

#. emotion: Sternly incredulous
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're in bed with your new wife."
msgstr "Ты в постели со своей новой женой."

#. emotion: With earnest surprise
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're in here, out in the real world. You're not in the citadel, you're not studying in any tower."
msgstr "Ты здесь, в реальном мире. Ты не в цитадели, ты не учишься в какой-то башне."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're in my house, so I suggest you answer my questions!"
msgstr "Ты в моём доме, так что советую отвечать на мои вопросы!"

#. emotion: In a hushed excited gasp
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're in my room! It's the dead of night!"
msgstr "Ты в моей комнате! Среди ночи!"

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're in my tent."
msgstr "Ты в моём шатре."

#. emotion: In a grand, reverent tone
msgctxt "speaker:Kim"
msgid "You're in the Estate of one of the most powerful men, in the capital of the most powerful empire in the world."
msgstr "Ты в поместье одного из самых могущественных людей, в столице самой могущественной империи в мире."

#. emotion: Anxiously concerned
msgctxt "speaker:Atilla"
msgid "You're injured."
msgstr "Ты ранена."

#. emotion: With intrigued bemusement
msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "You're insane, she told herself."
msgstr "Ты безумна, сказала она себе."

#. emotion: Annoyed exasperation
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're insane."
msgstr "Ты безумна."

#. emotion: Cautiously amused
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're insufferable."
msgstr "Ты невыносима."

#. emotion: Stern disappointment
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're just a grimy little nobody who got lucky in life."
msgstr "Ты просто грязный маленький никто, которому повезло в жизни."

#. emotion: Harsh, accusatory tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're just a pervert that want to see me naked."
msgstr "Ты просто извращенец, который хочет увидеть меня голой."

#. emotion: Dismissively condescending
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're just a spoiled princess, playing a poor game of politics."
msgstr "Ты просто избалованная принцесса, играющая в жалкую политическую игру."

#. emotion: In awe admiration
msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "You're just...perfect."
msgstr "Ты просто... совершенна."

#. emotion: Warmly, with affection
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're kind for saying it."
msgstr "Ты добра, говоря это."

#. emotion: Flatly mocking
msgctxt "speaker:Captain Belmont"
msgid "You're laughin, giggling at his every word. I wasn't born yesterday blondie."
msgstr "Ты смеёшься, хихикаешь над каждым его словом. Я не вчера родился, блонди."

#. emotion: With a hint of mischief
msgctxt "speaker:Samayra"
msgid "You're laughing."
msgstr "Ты смеёшься."

#. emotion: Curiously observing
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're leaving?"
msgstr "Ты уезжаешь?"

#. emotion: In a soft, contemplative tone
msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You're like..."
msgstr "Тебе же..."

